{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0175LQnLaPRHsSNcEWJYdNe6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claims 需要 scope 收窄但核心 framing 保留。Claim 1 调整为条件式检测能力声明——大 benchmark\n2\t  + 中高污染有效， minimal-info 代价可量化。Claim 2 保留 inverted-U 但增加 boundary condition。Claim\n3\t  3 缩小 audit 规模， Gemini-1.5 作为 converging evidence。论文定位从 practical detector 转向 principled\n4\t  framework with characterized operating envelope。Power-information tradeoff 的量化本身成为贡献。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Extended Simulation — High Contamination & Inverted-U Characterization\n9\t  plan_id: exp-extended-sim\n10\t  description: '扩展 Phase A 模拟至 60%/75%/90%/100% contamination，修复 100% boundary 处理，\n11\t    刻画 inverted-U 拐点位置，计算 two-sided power curves。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    mmlu_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.979\n16\t    mmlu_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.68\n17\t    mmlu_power_neg_at_75pct: 0.22\n18\t    mmlu_power_neg_at_90pct: 0.04\n19\t    mmlu_power_pos_at_60pct: 0.12\n20\t    mmlu_power_pos_at_75pct: 0.41\n21\t    mmlu_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.73\n22\t    mmlu_power_pos_at_100pct: 0.88\n23\t    mmlu_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n24\t    mmlu_crossover_point: 0.58\n25\t    hellaswag_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.733\n26\t    hellaswag_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.52\n27\t    hellaswag_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.61\n28\t    hellaswag_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n29\t    gsm8k_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.578\n30\t    gsm8k_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.38\n31\t    gsm8k_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.42\n32\t    arc_c_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.129\n33\t    arc_c_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.31\n34\t    humaneval_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.243\n35\t    humaneval_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.18\n36\t    inverted_u_r2_mmlu: 0.88\n37\t    inverted_u_r2_hellaswag: 0.84\n38\t    inverted_u_r2_gsm8k: 0.79\n39\t    inverted_u_r2_arc_c: 0.76\n40\t    inverted_u_r2_humaneval: 0.72\n41\t    inverted_u_mean_r2: 0.8\n42\t    mmlu_twosided_power_at_15pct: 0.979\n43\t    mmlu_twosided_power_at_50pct: 0.68\n44\t    mmlu_twosided_power_at_75pct: 0.41\n45\t    mmlu_twosided_power_at_90pct: 0.73\n46\t    mmlu_twosided_power_at_100pct: 0.88\n47\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 inverted-U 结构清晰存在但 transition zone (40%-70%) 出现 detection\n48\t    gap—— 负向信号衰减但正向信号尚未建立，形成 ~30pp 的 power trough。这是因为中度污染同时 提升了 ability estimate\n49\t    θ（减少 aberrance）又未达到完全一致（lz*>>0 需要几乎所有 item  都被预知）。MMLU 因 n=14K items 保持全程最强检测力，inverted-U\n50\t    R² 接近 0.9； 小 benchmark（ARC-C, HumanEval）因 lz* 方差大，inverted-U 拟合噪声更多，R² 降至 0.72-0.76。\n51\t    100% contamination 在 θ=4.0 boundary 处理后可计算，lz* 显著为正但受 boundary 效应影响 不如理论预期极端。整体\n52\t    inverted-U mean R² = 0.80 落在 tier 指标范围 [0.75, 0.90] 中段。\n53\t\n54\t    '\n55\t  tables:\n56\t  - name: 'Table: Two-Sided Power Matrix (Simulation)'\n57\t    columns:\n58\t    - benchmark\n59\t    - n_items\n60\t    - power@5%\n61\t    - power@15%\n62\t    - power@50%\n63\t    - power@75%\n64\t    - power@90%\n65\t    - power@100%\n66\t    - peak_contam\n67\t    - crossover\n68\t    rows:\n69\t    - - MMLU\n70\t      - 14042\n71\t      - 0.31\n72\t      - 0.98\n73\t      - 0.68\n74\t      - 0.41\n75\t      - 0.73\n76\t      - 0.88\n77\t      - 15%\n78\t      - 58%\n79\t    - - HellaSwag\n80\t      - 10042\n81\t      - 0.22\n82\t      - 0.73\n83\t      - 0.52\n84\t      - 0.33\n85\t      - 0.61\n86\t      - 0.78\n87\t      - 15%\n88\t      - 55%\n89\t    - - GSM8K\n90\t      - 1319\n91\t      - 0.11\n92\t      - 0.58\n93\t      - 0.38\n94\t      - 0.24\n95\t      - 0.42\n96\t      - 0.51\n97\t      - 10-15%\n98\t      - 52%\n99\t    - - ARC-C\n100\t      - 1172\n101\t      - 0.05\n102\t      - 0.13\n103\t      - 0.18\n104\t      - 0.14\n105\t      - 0.31\n106\t      - 0.39\n107\t      - 25-50%\n108\t      - 65%\n109\t    - - HumanEval\n110\t      - 164\n111\t      - 0.04\n112\t      - 0.24\n113\t      - 0.15\n114\t      - 0.09\n115\t      - 0.18\n116\t      - 0.22\n117\t      - 15%\n118\t      - N/A\n119\t    note: Power = max(P(lz*<-1.96), P(lz*>+1.96)) at each contamination level. Two-sided\n120\t      combined.\n121\t  - name: 'Table: Inverted-U Curve Parameters'\n122\t    columns:\n123\t    - benchmark\n124\t    - peak_neg_power\n125\t    - trough_power\n126\t    - trough_contam_range\n127\t    - recovery_power_at_100pct\n128\t    - R2_fit\n129\t    rows:\n130\t    - - MMLU\n131\t      - 0.979\n132\t      - 0.41\n133\t      - 70-80%\n134\t      - 0.88\n135\t      - 0.88\n136\t    - - HellaSwag\n137\t      - 0.733\n138\t      - 0.33\n139\t      - 65-80%\n140\t      - 0.78\n141\t      - 0.84\n142\t    - - GSM8K\n143\t      - 0.578\n144\t      - 0.24\n145\t      - 60-80%\n146\t      - 0.51\n147\t      - 0.79\n148\t    - - ARC-C\n149\t      - 0.129\n150\t      - 0.13\n151\t      - 15-50%\n152\t      - 0.39\n153\t      - 0.76\n154\t    - - HumanEval\n155\t      - 0.243\n156\t      - 0.09\n157\t      - 60-85%\n158\t      - 0.22\n159\t      - 0.72\n160\t  figures_description:\n161\t  - 'Fig: Inverted-U power curves per benchmark (x=contamination%, y=detection power),\n162\t    showing negative-side (blue, dashed) and positive-side (red, dashed) power separately,\n163\t    plus two-sided envelope (black, solid). Shaded gray band marks the detection trough\n164\t    zone. MMLU curve clearly U-shaped; HumanEval curve nearly flat with wide confidence\n165\t    bands.'\n166\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap of detection power (contamination level × benchmark), color-coded\n167\t    green (>0.8) / yellow (0.5-0.8) / red (<0.5). Clear diagonal pattern: large benchmarks\n168\t    green at moderate contamination, small benchmarks mostly red/yellow throughout.'\n169\t  analysis: 'Inverted-U 在 MMLU 和 HellaSwag 上结构清晰——峰值在 15% 左右，trough 在 70-80%， 100%\n170\t    恢复至 0.78-0.88。但小 benchmark 的 inverted-U 更像一条低矮的丘陵而非清晰的 U 型。 这为 Claim 2 提供支持但需要加\n171\t    boundary condition：inverted-U 的理论形状成立， 但只有 n_items ≥ 5K 时 peak power 才超过 0.7，使检测具有实际意义。\n172\t    Detection trough（40-70%）是一个必须在论文中诚实报告的盲区。\n173\t\n174\t    '\n175\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot — Go/No-Go\n176\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n177\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz* 是否显著。 论文 go/no-go\n178\t    决策点。\n179\t\n180\t    '\n181\t  expected_results:\n182\t    qwen_clean_mmlu_accuracy: 0.71\n183\t    qwen_clean_mmlu_theta: 1.05\n184\t    qwen_clean_mmlu_lz_star: 18.5\n185\t    qwen_15pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.78\n186\t    qwen_15pct_mmlu_theta: 1.42\n187\t    qwen_15pct_mmlu_lz_star: 23.8\n188\t    qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n189\t    qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star_cohen_d: 1.2\n190\t    qwen_15pct_delta_accuracy: 0.07\n191\t    qwen_50pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.89\n192\t    qwen_50pct_mmlu_theta: 2.31\n193\t    qwen_50pct_mmlu_lz_star: 14.2\n194\t    qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star: -4.3\n195\t    qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star_direction: decreased (toward normal or positive)\n196\t    qwen_50pct_delta_accuracy: 0.18\n197\t    ttest_clean_vs_15pct_p: 0.028\n198\t    ttest_clean_vs_50pct_p: 0.11\n199\t    bootstrap_ci_delta_15pct:\n200\t    - 1.8\n201\t    - 8.9\n202\t    bootstrap_ci_delta_50pct:\n203\t    - -9.1\n204\t    - 0.5\n205\t    go_signal: CONDITIONAL GO\n206\t    go_signal_detail: Δlz* significant at 15% but inverted-U already visible at 50%\n207\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：SFT 注入后 Δlz* 存在但效应量中等。Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上\n208\t    已经有高 lz*（~18.5），因为所有 LLM 都违反 IRT 假设（Phase B 已证实 universal misfit）。 15% SFT 污染在\n209\t    14K-item MMLU 上产生足够多的 aberrant responses——模型在本不该答对的 hard items（低 θ 区域）上答对，lz*\n210\t    进一步偏离，Cohen''s d ~1.2 可检测。但 50% 污染 触发 inverted-U 效应：大量 item 被记忆后 θ 估计大幅上升（1.05→2.31），模型看起来\n211\t    像一个\"真正高能力\"的 examinee，aberrance pattern 被 smoothed——lz* 反而回落甚至 可能低于 baseline。SFT\n212\t    泛化效应（domain 内未直接训练 items 的准确率也提升）进一步 稀释了 aberrance 信号。这给出 conditional go：15% 有信号，但\n213\t    50% 的 inverted-U 效应 意味着高污染检测需要依赖正向 lz* 阈值，而 50% 可能恰好落在 trough zone。 P 值在 15% 边缘显著（0.028），50%\n214\t    不显著（0.11）——因为 Δ 方向反转且 variance 大。\n215\t\n216\t    '\n217\t  tables:\n218\t  - name: 'Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU'\n219\t    columns:\n220\t    - condition\n221\t    - accuracy\n222\t    - theta\n223\t    - lz_star\n224\t    - delta_lz_star\n225\t    - cohen_d\n226\t    - p_value\n227\t    rows:\n228\t    - - 0% (clean)\n229\t      - 0.71\n230\t      - 1.05\n231\t      - 18.5\n232\t      - —\n233\t      - —\n234\t      - —\n235\t    - - 15%\n236\t      - 0.78\n237\t      - 1.42\n238\t      - 23.8\n239\t      - 5.3\n240\t      - 1.2\n241\t      - 0.028\n242\t    - - 50%\n243\t      - 0.89\n244\t      - 2.31\n245\t      - 14.2\n246\t      - -4.3\n247\t      - 0.9\n248\t      - 0.11\n249\t    note: lz* computed with benchmark-specific θ and bootstrap (n=1000). Cohen's d\n250\t      = |Δlz*| / pooled_sd across 3 random seeds.\n251\t  figures_description:\n252\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart with 3 conditions (clean/15%/50%), y-axis = lz*, error bars =\n253\t    bootstrap 95% CI. Shows non-monotonic pattern: lz* rises at 15% then drops at\n254\t    50%, illustrating inverted-U in real SFT data.'\n255\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of per-subject accuracy delta (y) vs per-subject lz* delta\n256\t    (x) at 15% contamination. Shows that subjects with largest accuracy gains also\n257\t    have largest lz* increase — contamination signal is concentrated in directly trained\n258\t    domains.'\n259\t  analysis: 'Pilot 给出 conditional go。15% 的 Δlz* = +5.3 (Cohen''s d = 1.2) 在 MMLU 上显著，\n260\t    证明 SFT 污染可被 person-fit 检测。但 50% 的信号反转确认了 inverted-U 在真实 SFT 数据中 存在，且 trough 比模拟更早出现（模拟中\n261\t    trough 在 70-80%，实际 50% 已开始回落）， 可能因为 SFT 泛化效应（domain-level accuracy boost）提前了 θ\n262\t    上升。 Go/no-go 判定：GO，但需要在完整实验中加入 25% 污染水平以精确定位 real-data inverted-U peak。\n263\t\n264\t    '\n265\t- name: Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\n266\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n267\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B × 6 contamination levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%)\n268\t    × 5 benchmarks。 建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 完整映射。\n269\t\n270\t    '\n271\t  expected_results:\n272\t    qwen_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 18.5\n273\t    qwen_mmlu_5pct_lz_star: 19.8\n274\t    qwen_mmlu_5pct_delta: 1.3\n275\t    qwen_mmlu_5pct_cohen_d: 0.3\n276\t    qwen_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.58\n277\t    qwen_mmlu_10pct_lz_star: 21.6\n278\t    qwen_mmlu_10pct_delta: 3.1\n279\t    qwen_mmlu_10pct_cohen_d: 0.7\n280\t    qwen_mmlu_10pct_auroc: 0.68\n281\t    qwen_mmlu_15pct_lz_star: 23.8\n282\t    qwen_mmlu_15pct_delta: 5.3\n283\t    qwen_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 1.2\n284\t    qwen_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.79\n285\t    qwen_mmlu_25pct_lz_star: 22.1\n286\t    qwen_mmlu_25pct_delta: 3.6\n287\t    qwen_mmlu_25pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n288\t    qwen_mmlu_25pct_auroc: 0.72\n289\t    qwen_mmlu_50pct_lz_star: 14.2\n290\t    qwen_mmlu_50pct_delta: -4.3\n291\t    qwen_mmlu_50pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n292\t    qwen_mmlu_50pct_auroc: 0.64\n293\t    qwen_hellaswag_clean_lz_star: 15.2\n294\t    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.8\n295\t    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n296\t    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.74\n297\t    qwen_hellaswag_5pct_auroc: 0.55\n298\t    qwen_gsm8k_clean_lz_star: 6.1\n299\t    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_delta: 1.9\n300\t    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_cohen_d: 0.6\n301\t    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_auroc: 0.63\n302\t    qwen_gsm8k_5pct_auroc: 0.52\n303\t    qwen_arcc_clean_lz_star: 4.8\n304\t    qwen_arcc_15pct_delta: 1.1\n305\t    qwen_arcc_15pct_cohen_d: 0.4\n306\t    qwen_arcc_15pct_auroc: 0.58\n307\t    qwen_arcc_5pct_auroc: 0.51\n308\t    qwen_humaneval_clean_lz_star: 2.3\n309\t    qwen_humaneval_15pct_delta: 0.6\n310\t    qwen_humaneval_15pct_cohen_d: 0.2\n311\t    qwen_humaneval_15pct_auroc: 0.54\n312\t    gemma_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 22.1\n313\t    gemma_mmlu_15pct_delta: 4.1\n314\t    gemma_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 0.95\n315\t    gemma_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.76\n316\t    gemma_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.56\n317\t    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.2\n318\t    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n319\t    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.71\n320\t    cross_model_delta_direction_agreement_15pct: 5/5 benchmarks same direction\n321\t    cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_mmlu: 1.29\n322\t    cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_hellaswag: 1.19\n323\t    cross_model_spearman_delta_across_benchmarks: 0.7\n324\t    sft_generalization_domain_accuracy_boost: 0.03\n325\t    sft_generalization_nontrained_item_accuracy_delta: 0.02\n326\t    n_conditions_auroc_above_0.7: 4/12 (MMLU×2models + HellaSwag×2models at 15%)\n327\t    n_conditions_auroc_above_0.8: 0/12\n328\t    overall_detection_threshold: ≥15% contamination AND ≥5K items\n329\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档的核心预测：Cohen''s d 在 0.8-2.0 之间，仅 ≥15% + ≥5K items 可靠分离。\n330\t\n331\t    5% 污染检测力不足（AUROC < 0.70）——因为 5% 对应 MMLU 仅 ~700 items 被记忆， 产生的 aberrant pattern\n332\t    在 14K-item 的 lz* 计算中被 noise 淹没。SFT 泛化效应 使未直接训练的同 domain items 也提升了 ~2-3pp 准确率，进一步稀释信号。\n333\t\n334\t    15% 是 sweet spot——~2100 items 产生足够 aberrance，且 θ 尚未被推高到  identifiability collapse\n335\t    区域。但即使在 MMLU 上 AUROC 也只有 0.79 而非 0.95+， 因为 baseline lz* 已经很高（~18.5），Δlz* = 5.3\n336\t    相对于 baseline variance 只是中等效应。\n337\t\n338\t    25% 开始出现 inverted-U 衰减——θ 上升使部分 hard items 变得\"合理答对\"， aberrance 减少。50% 信号反转。\n339\t\n340\t    小 benchmark（ARC-C 1172 items, HumanEval 164 items）在所有污染水平下 都无法可靠检测——lz* 的 sampling\n341\t    variance 与 n_items^(-1/2) 成正比， 164 items 的 SE 比 14K items 大 ~9 倍。\n342\t\n343\t    跨模型方向一致（两个模型在 5/5 benchmarks 上 Δlz* 同向），但幅度差异 20-30%——Gemma-4-31B baseline 更强（θ\n344\t    更高），留给污染信号的\"空间\"更小。 这符合 tier 预测的\"方向一致但幅度差异大\"。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  tables:\n348\t  - name: 'Table: AUROC by Contamination Level × Benchmark (Qwen3.5-9B)'\n349\t    columns:\n350\t    - benchmark\n351\t    - n_items\n352\t    - AUROC@5%\n353\t    - AUROC@10%\n354\t    - AUROC@15%\n355\t    - AUROC@25%\n356\t    - AUROC@50%\n357\t    rows:\n358\t    - - MMLU\n359\t      - 14042\n360\t      - 0.58\n361\t      - 0.68\n362\t      - 0.79\n363\t      - 0.72\n364\t      - 0.64\n365\t    - - HellaSwag\n366\t      - 10042\n367\t      - 0.55\n368\t      - 0.63\n369\t      - 0.74\n370\t      - 0.68\n371\t      - 0.59\n372\t    - - GSM8K\n373\t      - 1319\n374\t      - 0.52\n375\t      - 0.57\n376\t      - 0.63\n377\t      - 0.6\n378\t      - 0.55\n379\t    - - ARC-C\n380\t      - 1172\n381\t      - 0.51\n382\t      - 0.54\n383\t      - 0.58\n384\t      - 0.56\n385\t      - 0.53\n386\t    - - HumanEval\n387\t      - 164\n388\t      - 0.5\n389\t      - 0.52\n390\t      - 0.54\n391\t      - 0.53\n392\t      - 0.51\n393\t    note: AUROC computed over 3 seeds per condition. Chance = 0.50.\n394\t  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d at 15% Contamination — Cross-Model Comparison'\n395\t    columns:\n396\t    - benchmark\n397\t    - qwen_d\n398\t    - gemma_d\n399\t    - direction_agree\n400\t    - magnitude_ratio\n401\t    rows:\n402\t    - - MMLU\n403\t      - 1.2\n404\t      - 0.95\n405\t      - 'yes'\n406\t      - 1.26\n407\t    - - HellaSwag\n408\t      - 0.9\n409\t      - 0.8\n410\t      - 'yes'\n411\t      - 1.13\n412\t    - - GSM8K\n413\t      - 0.6\n414\t      - 0.5\n415\t      - 'yes'\n416\t      - 1.2\n417\t    - - ARC-C\n418\t      - 0.4\n419\t      - 0.3\n420\t      - 'yes'\n421\t      - 1.33\n422\t    - - HumanEval\n423\t      - 0.2\n424\t      - 0.15\n425\t      - 'yes'\n426\t      - 1.33\n427\t  - name: 'Table: SFT Generalization Analysis (Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU, 15%)'\n428\t    columns:\n429\t    - item_category\n430\t    - n_items\n431\t    - accuracy_clean\n432\t    - accuracy_contam\n433\t    - delta_acc\n434\t    - delta_lz_star_contribution\n435\t    rows:\n436\t    - - Directly trained items\n437\t      - 2106\n438\t      - 0.65\n439\t      - 0.94\n440\t      - 0.29\n441\t      - dominant signal source\n442\t    - - Same-domain untrained\n443\t      - 4200\n444\t      - 0.7\n445\t      - 0.73\n446\t      - 0.03\n447\t      - noise / dilution\n448\t    - - Other-domain items\n449\t      - 7736\n450\t      - 0.73\n451\t      - 0.74\n452\t      - 0.01\n453\t      - negligible\n454\t  figures_description:\n455\t  - 'Fig: Δlz* dose-response curves for both models × MMLU. X-axis = contamination\n456\t    level, Y-axis = Δlz* from clean baseline. Inverted-U clearly visible: peak at\n457\t    15-25%, crossing zero around 40-50%. Qwen curve consistently above Gemma by ~1-2\n458\t    lz* units. Error bars (3 seeds) overlap at 5% and 50% but separate at 15%.'\n459\t  - 'Fig: AUROC heatmap (contamination level × benchmark × model). 2×5×5 grid. Only\n460\t    the top-left quadrant (≥15% × ≥5K items) is green (>0.70). Strong diagonal gradient\n461\t    from top-left to bottom-right.'\n462\t  - 'Fig: Per-item analysis at 15% contamination — scatter of item difficulty (b parameter)\n463\t    vs P(correct|contaminated) - P(correct|clean). Directly trained items cluster\n464\t    in high-difficulty, high-delta region. SFT generalization items show small diffuse\n465\t    delta.'\n466\t  analysis: '核心结论：IRT-FIT 在 controlled contamination 下给出 medium-effect detection，\n467\t    operating envelope 为 ≥15% contamination + ≥5K items + negative-lz* regime。 这不是一个\n468\t    practical detector（AUROC 未超过 0.80），但成功量化了 minimal-information  的代价——同样 ground-truth\n469\t    数据上 ConStat 预期 AUROC 0.85-0.95（需 exp-baseline-comparison 确认）。 SFT 泛化效应是信号衰减的主要原因之一——约\n470\t    3pp 的 domain-level accuracy boost  让 ~30% 的非训练 items 也被答对，稀释了 aberrance pattern。\n471\t    论文需要诚实报告 operating envelope 并将 power-information tradeoff 作为核心贡献。\n472\t\n473\t    '\n474\t- name: Theoretical Power Derivation\n475\t  plan_id: exp-power-theory\n476\t  description: '基于 Snijders (2001) lz* 方差公式推导 power ∝ f(n_items, contam_rate) 的解析关系，\n477\t    验证理论曲线与模拟的拟合度，建立 inverted-U 的理论基础。\n478\t\n479\t    '\n480\t  expected_results:\n481\t    theory_vs_sim_r2_negative_regime: 0.91\n482\t    theory_vs_sim_r2_positive_regime: 0.83\n483\t    theory_vs_sim_r2_combined: 0.85\n484\t    min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_15pct: 8200\n485\t    min_n_items_for_power_0.5_at_15pct: 2800\n486\t    min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_5pct: '>50000 (extrapolated)'\n487\t    inverted_u_peak_formula: contam_peak ≈ σ²(θ) / (2 × E[I(θ)]) — depends on ability\n488\t      variance and test information\n489\t    inverted_u_peak_predicted_mmlu: 0.17\n490\t    inverted_u_peak_observed_mmlu: 0.15\n491\t    inverted_u_trough_depth_formula: proportional to n_items^(-1/2) × contam_rate\n492\t      × (1 - contam_rate)\n493\t    power_scaling: Power ∝ sqrt(n_items) × contam_rate × g(θ_shift) where g is a non-monotone\n494\t      function capturing the inverted-U\n495\t    identifiability_collapse_threshold: contam_rate at which E[θ_contam] > θ_max_discriminating\n496\t      ≈ 3.0\n497\t  result_rationale: 'Snijders (2001) 给出 Var(lz*) ≈ 1 + O(1/n) 在零假设下。污染注入等价于 向 response\n498\t    vector 添加 n×c 个\"能力不匹配\"的正确回答（c = contamination rate）。\n499\t\n500\t    在负向 regime（低-中污染），lz* 的期望偏移 ∝ sqrt(n) × c × Σ[log P_j(θ) 的 aberrance term]， power\n501\t    随 sqrt(n) 增长——这解释了为什么 MMLU (14K) 的 power 远超 ARC-C (1172)。 理论与模拟在负向 regime 拟合良好（R²\n502\t    = 0.91），因为 Snijders 的正态近似在 大 n 下准确。\n503\t\n504\t    正向 regime 拟合较差（R² = 0.83）因为 identifiability collapse 涉及 θ 估计的 boundary 效应——当 θ\n505\t    → ∞ 时 MLE 不稳定，理论公式的渐近近似失效。 这也是 median 档的体现：理论框架基本成立但在边界条件下精度降低。\n506\t\n507\t    min_n_items 阈值计算表明 5% 污染在任何现有 benchmark 上都不可检测 （需 >50K items），支持 \"scope 收窄\" 的叙事——IRT-FIT\n508\t    不是万能探测器， 它在特定 operating envelope 内工作。\n509\t\n510\t    '\n511\t  tables:\n512\t  - name: 'Table: Theoretical vs Simulated Power'\n513\t    columns:\n514\t    - benchmark\n515\t    - n_items\n516\t    - sim_power_15pct\n517\t    - theory_power_15pct\n518\t    - residual\n519\t    - sim_power_5pct\n520\t    - theory_power_5pct\n521\t    - residual_5pct\n522\t    rows:\n523\t    - - MMLU\n524\t      - 14042\n525\t      - 0.979\n526\t      - 0.96\n527\t      - 0.019\n528\t      - 0.31\n529\t      - 0.28\n530\t      - 0.03\n531\t    - - HellaSwag\n532\t      - 10042\n533\t      - 0.733\n534\t      - 0.75\n535\t      - -0.017\n536\t      - 0.22\n537\t      - 0.2\n538\t      - 0.02\n539\t    - - GSM8K\n540\t      - 1319\n541\t      - 0.578\n542\t      - 0.54\n543\t      - 0.038\n544\t      - 0.11\n545\t      - 0.1\n546\t      - 0.01\n547\t    - - ARC-C\n548\t      - 1172\n549\t      - 0.129\n550\t      - 0.15\n551\t      - -0.021\n552\t      - 0.05\n553\t      - 0.06\n554\t      - -0.01\n555\t    - - HumanEval\n556\t      - 164\n557\t      - 0.243\n558\t      - 0.21\n559\t      - 0.033\n560\t      - 0.04\n561\t      - 0.04\n562\t      - 0.0\n563\t    note: ARC-C 偏差大因为 item parameters 分布偏离理论假设（难度集中在窄范围）\n564\t  - name: 'Table: Minimum n_items for Target Power'\n565\t    columns:\n566\t    - target_power\n567\t    - contam_5pct\n568\t    - contam_10pct\n569\t    - contam_15pct\n570\t    - contam_25pct\n571\t    rows:\n572\t    - - 0.5\n573\t      - '>50K'\n574\t      - 12000\n575\t      - 2800\n576\t      - 900\n577\t    - - 0.8\n578\t      - '>50K'\n579\t      - 25000\n580\t      - 8200\n581\t      - 2200\n582\t    - - 0.9\n583\t      - '>50K'\n584\t      - 40000\n585\t      - 12500\n586\t      - 3500\n587\t  figures_description:\n588\t  - 'Fig: Power surface — 3D plot with axes (n_items, contamination_rate, power).\n589\t    Theoretical surface in translucent blue, simulation data points as red dots. Good\n590\t    agreement in the low-contamination quadrant, visible divergence at high-contamination\n591\t    + small-n corner.'\n592\t  - 'Fig: Inverted-U decomposition — theoretical curves showing negative-lz* contribution\n593\t    (monotone decreasing in contam_rate) and positive-lz* contribution (monotone increasing),\n594\t    with their sum producing the U shape. Annotated with the peak location formula.'\n595\t  analysis: '理论推导成功建立了 power-n_items-contamination 的解析关系，inverted-U 从经验观察 升级为可推导的理论命题。关键贡献是\n596\t    minimum n_items 表格——这给审稿人和用户一个 直接可用的查询工具。理论与模拟的 combined R² = 0.85 表明理论框架基本正确，\n597\t    但需要承认在 identifiability collapse 附近的近似误差。 这是论文的一个坚实理论贡献，即使检测力本身是 medium。\n598\t\n599\t    '\n600\t- name: Leaderboard Data Reconnaissance\n601\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\n602\t  description: '调研 HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 per-item binary response\n603\t    data 可用性、格式、覆盖范围。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t  expected_results:\n607\t    hf_results_repo_exists: true\n608\t    per_item_binary_logs_available: partial\n609\t    format: JSON with per-example predictions, not standardized across all models\n610\t    n_models_total_in_leaderboard: 7000+\n611\t    n_models_with_per_item_data: 280\n612\t    n_models_with_complete_5benchmark_data: 150\n613\t    benchmarks_covered:\n614\t    - MMLU\n615\t    - HellaSwag\n616\t    - ARC-C\n617\t    - TruthfulQA\n618\t    - Winogrande\n619\t    - GSM8K\n620\t    data_format_issues: variable JSON schema across submission dates; some models\n621\t      only have aggregate scores; harness version differences (lm-eval v0.3 vs v0.4)\n622\t    estimated_gpu_hours_to_supplement: 120\n623\t    recommendation: proceed with 150-280 available models; supplement top-50 missing\n624\t      flagships via inference\n625\t  result_rationale: 'HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1（2023-2024 运行）使用 lm-evaluation-harness，\n626\t    其结果存储在 open-llm-leaderboard-old/results repo 中。该 repo 包含 per-model  结果目录，但格式不统一——早期提交只有\n627\t    aggregate JSON，后期版本包含 per-example logs。\n628\t\n629\t    Median 档预测 100-500 models 有 per-item data。实际可能约 280 个模型有可用的 per-item 级别数据，因为 lm-eval-harness\n630\t    在某个版本后开始默认保存 per-example  predictions，但不是所有提交者都上传了完整日志。150 个模型有完整 5-benchmark\n631\t    数据， 足够进行 IRT 参数估计和 person-fit 计算。\n632\t\n633\t    这是 median 档的典型场景——数据部分可用，需要工程投入去解析不统一的格式， 但不需要从零开始跑推理。280 个模型比 Phase B 的 12 个大\n634\t    23 倍， 足以支撑 Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit，但无法声称是\"全面扫描\"。\n635\t\n636\t    '\n637\t  tables:\n638\t  - name: 'Table: Data Availability Summary'\n639\t    columns:\n640\t    - category\n641\t    - count\n642\t    - pct_of_total\n643\t    - notes\n644\t    rows:\n645\t    - - Total models on leaderboard\n646\t      - 7200\n647\t      - 100%\n648\t      - ''\n649\t    - - Models with any results JSON\n650\t      - 5800\n651\t      - 80.6%\n652\t      - some only aggregate\n653\t    - - Models with per-item predictions\n654\t      - 280\n655\t      - 3.9%\n656\t      - lm-eval ≥v0.4\n657\t    - - Models with complete 5-bench per-item\n658\t      - 150\n659\t      - 2.1%\n660\t      - usable for IRT-FIT\n661\t    - - Top-50 flagships missing per-item\n662\t      - 38\n663\t      - —\n664\t      - would need inference runs\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - 'Fig: Timeline of per-item data availability on leaderboard — x-axis = submission\n667\t    date, y-axis = cumulative models with per-item data. Sharp uptick after lm-eval\n668\t    v0.4 release, plateau when leaderboard v1 closed.'\n669\t  analysis: '280 models with per-item data 落在 tier 预测的 [100, 500] 范围内。 足够支撑 leaderboard\n670\t    audit 但需要在论文中明确说明覆盖率限制。 建议策略：用 280 个可用模型做主分析，补充 top-50 缺失的旗舰模型（约 38 个需推理）， 总计\n671\t    ~320 个模型。GPU 补充预算 ~20 hrs（38 models × ~0.5 hr each）可控。\n672\t\n673\t    '\n674\t- name: Leaderboard Audit — Large-Scale Person-Fit Scan\n675\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n676\t  description: '对 ~280+ 可用模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit，绘制污染率趋势， 识别系统性异常模型。\n677\t\n678\t    '\n679\t  expected_results:\n680\t    n_models_analyzed: 310\n681\t    n_benchmarks: 5\n682\t    total_model_benchmark_cells: 1550\n683\t    flagged_rate_mmlu_delta_method: 0.22\n684\t    flagged_rate_hellaswag_delta_method: 0.18\n685\t    flagged_rate_gsm8k_delta_method: 0.28\n686\t    flagged_rate_arcc_delta_method: 0.15\n687\t    flagged_rate_humaneval_delta_method: 0.12\n688\t    overall_flagged_rate: 0.19\n689\t    n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 18\n690\t    n_models_flagged_all_5: 3\n691\t    top_flagged_model_1: Gemini-1.5-Pro (4/5 benchmarks, highest Δlz* on MMLU)\n692\t    top_flagged_model_2: model_family_X (multiple sizes all flagged — systematic)\n693\t    top_flagged_model_3: model_Y (GSM8K + MATH specialist, extreme negative lz* on\n694\t      math benchmarks)\n695\t    flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.12\n696\t    flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.18\n697\t    flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.25\n698\t    temporal_trend_significant: true\n699\t    temporal_trend_spearman: 0.38\n700\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_hellaswag: 0.31\n701\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_gsm8k: 0.22\n702\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_mean: 0.35\n703\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_n_significant: 3/10 pairs\n704\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档预测 leaderboard_flagged_rate_relative 在 [0.1, 0.4]，cross_benchmark_spearman  在\n705\t    [0.3, 0.6]。\n706\t\n707\t    Overall flagged rate ~19% 反映了两个因素的叠加：(1) 确实存在的 benchmark gaming—— 开源社区中\"benchmark\n708\t    hacking\"是公开的秘密，部分模型在 MMLU/GSM8K 训练集上做过 SFT； (2) Δlz* calibration 的不完美——controlled\n709\t    experiment 建立的阈值基于 2 个模型， 可能对其他架构/训练策略不够 robust，产生一定 false positives。\n710\t\n711\t    时间趋势（12%→25%）有真实基础：2023 下半年到 2024 年，leaderboard 竞争加剧， 更多模型被发现在 benchmark data\n712\t    上训练。但趋势的 effect size 中等（Spearman 0.38）， 因为早期模型中也有污染（只是比例低）且后期有些模型反而更注意避免。\n713\t\n714\t    Cross-benchmark 相关性弱到中等（mean 0.35）——这是 median 档的关键特征。 如果污染是系统性的（同一训练流程污染所有 benchmark），相关性应该高；\n715\t    但实际上很多模型只在特定 benchmark 上有异常（如只刷 GSM8K 或只刷 MMLU）， 导致 per-benchmark 信号不一致。3/10 pairs\n716\t    显著优于 Phase B 的 1/10， 但仍然不足以支撑\"全面跨 benchmark 一致性\"的强声明。\n717\t\n718\t    18 个模型在 3+ benchmarks 被标记——这些是最可信的 converging evidence cases， 论文应聚焦于这些而非整体 flagged\n719\t    rate。\n720\t\n721\t    '\n722\t  tables:\n723\t  - name: 'Table: Leaderboard Flagged Rate by Benchmark'\n724\t    columns:\n725\t    - benchmark\n726\t    - n_items\n727\t    - n_models\n728\t    - flagged_count\n729\t    - flagged_rate\n730\t    - median_delta_lz_star_flagged\n731\t    - 95%CI_flagged_rate\n732\t    rows:\n733\t    - - MMLU\n734\t      - 14042\n735\t      - 310\n736\t      - 68\n737\t      - 0.22\n738\t      - 4.8\n739\t      - '[0.17, 0.27]'\n740\t    - - HellaSwag\n741\t      - 10042\n742\t      - 310\n743\t      - 56\n744\t      - 0.18\n745\t      - 3.5\n746\t      - '[0.14, 0.23]'\n747\t    - - GSM8K\n748\t      - 1319\n749\t      - 310\n750\t      - 87\n751\t      - 0.28\n752\t      - 2.1\n753\t      - '[0.23, 0.33]'\n754\t    - - ARC-C\n755\t      - 1172\n756\t      - 310\n757\t      - 47\n758\t      - 0.15\n759\t      - 1.4\n760\t      - '[0.11, 0.20]'\n761\t    - - HumanEval\n762\t      - 164\n763\t      - 310\n764\t      - 37\n765\t      - 0.12\n766\t      - 0.8\n767\t      - '[0.08, 0.16]'\n768\t    note: Flagging based on Δlz* > threshold calibrated from exp-ctrl-contam (15%\n769\t      contamination boundary). GSM8K high rate may reflect both real contamination\n770\t      AND low-n-items false positives.\n771\t  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagged Models'\n772\t    columns:\n773\t    - n_benchmarks_flagged\n774\t    - n_models\n775\t    - example_models\n776\t    rows:\n777\t    - - 5\n778\t      - 3\n779\t      - Gemini-1.5-Pro, model_A, model_B\n780\t    - - 4\n781\t      - 7\n782\t      - model_C, model_D, ...\n783\t    - - 3\n784\t      - 8\n785\t      - model_E, model_F, ...\n786\t    - - 2\n787\t      - 23\n788\t      - —\n789\t    - - 1\n790\t      - 18\n791\t      - —\n792\t    - - 0\n793\t      - 251\n794\t      - —\n795\t  - name: 'Table: Temporal Contamination Trend'\n796\t    columns:\n797\t    - period\n798\t    - n_models\n799\t    - flagged_any\n800\t    - flagged_rate\n801\t    - flagged_≥3_bench\n802\t    rows:\n803\t    - - 2023 H1\n804\t      - 85\n805\t      - 10\n806\t      - 0.12\n807\t      - 1\n808\t    - - 2023 H2\n809\t      - 120\n810\t      - 22\n811\t      - 0.18\n812\t      - 5\n813\t    - - 2024 H1\n814\t      - 105\n815\t      - 26\n816\t      - 0.25\n817\t      - 12\n818\t  figures_description:\n819\t  - 'Fig: Leaderboard contamination landscape — scatter of models by (x=mean_accuracy,\n820\t    y=mean_delta_lz_star), color-coded by number of benchmarks flagged (0=gray, 1=yellow,\n821\t    2=orange, 3+=red). High-accuracy + high-Δlz* quadrant contains the most suspicious\n822\t    models. Gemini-1.5 is an obvious outlier.'\n823\t  - 'Fig: Temporal trend — stacked bar chart by submission half-year, showing flagged\n824\t    (red) vs clean (gray) models. Increasing red proportion over time.'\n825\t  - 'Fig: Cross-benchmark Δlz* correlation matrix (10 pairs), with significant correlations\n826\t    highlighted. Mostly weak (0.2-0.4) with 3 significant pairs.'\n827\t  analysis: 'Leaderboard audit 给出 median-range 结果：19% overall flagged rate，时间趋势存在但中等，\n828\t    cross-benchmark 一致性弱。论文应采用保守叙事策略：聚焦于 18 个 multi-benchmark flagged  模型作为 high-confidence\n829\t    cases，报告整体 flagged rate 作为 upper bound estimate， 明确说明 false positive rate 由 controlled\n830\t    experiment calibration 的 transferability 限制。 Gemini-1.5 case study 从\"定义性证据\"降级为\"与\n831\t    leaderboard-wide pattern 一致的 converging evidence\"。\n832\t\n833\t    '\n834\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n835\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n836\t  description: '比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) vs 3PL (d=1 fixed) 下 detection\n837\t    sensitivity 差异。\n838\t\n839\t    '\n840\t  expected_results:\n841\t    sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.979\n842\t    sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.952\n843\t    sim_power_delta_mmlu: -0.027\n844\t    sim_power_4pl_arcc_15pct: 0.129\n845\t    sim_power_3pl_arcc_15pct: 0.108\n846\t    sim_power_delta_arcc: -0.021\n847\t    sim_fpr_4pl_alpha005: 0.048\n848\t    sim_fpr_3pl_alpha005: 0.062\n849\t    real_data_flagged_4pl: 57\n850\t    real_data_flagged_3pl: 54\n851\t    real_data_agreement: 52/60 cells agree\n852\t    mean_d_across_benchmarks: 0.92\n853\t    pct_items_d_lt_0.9: 0.31\n854\t    d_impact_on_lz_star_correlation: 0.97\n855\t  result_rationale: \"4PL 的 feasibility parameter d < 1 表示即使完全掌握 item 也无法保证答对 （如题目表述模糊或\\\n856\t    \\ label 有误）。当 d 接近 1 时 4PL ≈ 3PL。\\nPSN-IRT 估计的平均 d = 0.92，说明大多数 items d 接近 1，\\\n857\t    \\ 但有 ~31% 的 items d < 0.9（可能是有噪声的标注）。\\n在 median 档下，d 参数的影响是可测但不大的： - 4PL 的 lz*\\\n858\t    \\ 对 high-ability examinees 更宽容（因为 d<1 意味着满分不太可能），\\n  这略微提高了检测灵敏度（~2-3pp power\\\n859\t    \\ improvement）。\\n- 在 false alarm 控制上 4PL 更好（0.048 vs 0.062），因为 3PL 在 d<1 items\\\n860\t    \\ 上\\n  会过度惩罚\\\"答错高概率题目\\\"的 pattern。\\n- 但整体差异不大：4PL vs 3PL 的 lz* 相关性 0.97，flagging\\\n861\t    \\ 一致率 87%。\\n这个 ablation 的贡献是 confirming rather than surprising——4PL 略优但 3PL 也可用，\\\n862\t    \\ 意味着方法对 item parameter 选择不过度敏感。\\n\"\n863\t  tables:\n864\t  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (Simulation)'\n865\t    columns:\n866\t    - benchmark\n867\t    - power_4PL@15%\n868\t    - power_3PL@15%\n869\t    - delta\n870\t    - FPR_4PL\n871\t    - FPR_3PL\n872\t    rows:\n873\t    - - MMLU\n874\t      - 0.979\n875\t      - 0.952\n876\t      - -0.027\n877\t      - 0.048\n878\t      - 0.062\n879\t    - - HellaSwag\n880\t      - 0.733\n881\t      - 0.711\n882\t      - -0.022\n883\t      - 0.045\n884\t      - 0.058\n885\t    - - GSM8K\n886\t      - 0.578\n887\t      - 0.559\n888\t      - -0.019\n889\t      - 0.051\n890\t      - 0.065\n891\t    - - ARC-C\n892\t      - 0.129\n893\t      - 0.108\n894\t      - -0.021\n895\t      - 0.049\n896\t      - 0.067\n897\t    - - HumanEval\n898\t      - 0.243\n899\t      - 0.228\n900\t      - -0.015\n901\t      - 0.052\n902\t      - 0.061\n903\t  figures_description:\n904\t  - 'Fig: Scatter of lz*_4PL vs lz*_3PL across all (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect\n905\t    linear relationship (r=0.97) with slight divergence at extremes. Color-coded by\n906\t    mean item d parameter of benchmark.'\n907\t  analysis: '4PL 提供一致但微小的改进（~2-3pp power, ~1.5pp FPR reduction）。 足以证明 d 参数有理论和实证价值，但不是方法的核心驱动因素。\n908\t    论文建议：主实验用 4PL，附录报告 3PL 结果作为 robustness check。\n909\t\n910\t    '\n911\t- name: Baseline Comparison — IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++\n912\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n913\t  description: '在 controlled contamination ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT、ConStat、Min-K%++\n914\t    的检测能力， 量化 minimal-information 的代价。\n915\t\n916\t    '\n917\t  expected_results:\n918\t    auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.79\n919\t    auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.91\n920\t    auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n921\t    auroc_gap_vs_constat_mmlu: -0.12\n922\t    auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_mmlu: -0.15\n923\t    auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_5pct: 0.58\n924\t    auroc_constat_mmlu_5pct: 0.72\n925\t    auroc_minkpp_mmlu_5pct: 0.83\n926\t    auroc_irt_fit_hellaswag_15pct: 0.74\n927\t    auroc_constat_hellaswag_15pct: 0.87\n928\t    auroc_minkpp_hellaswag_15pct: 0.92\n929\t    auroc_gap_vs_constat_hellaswag: -0.13\n930\t    auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.63\n931\t    auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.78\n932\t    auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n933\t    auroc_gap_vs_constat_gsm8k: -0.15\n934\t    mean_auroc_gap_vs_constat_at_15pct: -0.13\n935\t    mean_auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_at_15pct: -0.16\n936\t    type1_irt_fit: 0.06\n937\t    type1_constat: 0.04\n938\t    type1_minkpp: 0.03\n939\t    info_irt_fit: binary responses only\n940\t    info_constat: binary responses + rephrased retest\n941\t    info_minkpp: token-level probabilities\n942\t    pareto_optimal: Min-K%++ > ConStat > IRT-FIT in detection; IRT-FIT > ConStat >\n943\t      Min-K%++ in applicability scope\n944\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：baseline_auroc_gap_vs_constat 在 [-0.20, -0.10]。\n945\t\n946\t    IRT-FIT AUROC 0.79 vs ConStat 0.91 (gap = -0.12) 在 MMLU@15% 符合预期。 ConStat 优势来自\n947\t    rephrased retest 信号——如果模型记忆了原始 item， rephrased 版本的准确率会下降，这是一个直接的 contamination\n948\t    indicator。 IRT-FIT 只能从 binary pattern 的 aberrance 间接推断，信息量先天不足。\n949\t\n950\t    Min-K%++ 的 AUROC 更高（0.94）因为 token-level probabilities 提供了 最丰富的信号——记忆的 item 有异常低的\n951\t    token surprisal。\n952\t\n953\t    但信息需求也成比例增加：Min-K%++ 需要 API 返回 logprobs（很多 API 不支持）， ConStat 需要生成 rephrased items\n954\t    并重新测试（需要 live model access）， IRT-FIT 只需要最终答案。在 Open LLM Leaderboard 这种场景下， 只有\n955\t    IRT-FIT 可以对历史提交进行 retrospective analysis。\n956\t\n957\t    Gap = -0.12 to -0.15 是 minimal-information 的\"代价\"——论文将这个代价 本身作为贡献来量化和讨论，而非试图论证\n958\t    IRT-FIT 性能优于 baselines。\n959\t\n960\t    '\n961\t  tables:\n962\t  - name: 'Table: Detection AUROC Comparison (Ground-Truth Controlled Contamination)'\n963\t    columns:\n964\t    - method\n965\t    - info_level\n966\t    - MMLU@5%\n967\t    - MMLU@15%\n968\t    - MMLU@25%\n969\t    - HellaSwag@15%\n970\t    - GSM8K@15%\n971\t    - ARC-C@15%\n972\t    rows:\n973\t    - - IRT-FIT (ours)\n974\t      - binary only\n975\t      - 0.58\n976\t      - 0.79\n977\t      - 0.72\n978\t      - 0.74\n979\t      - 0.63\n980\t      - 0.58\n981\t    - - ConStat\n982\t      - binary + retest\n983\t      - 0.72\n984\t      - 0.91\n985\t      - 0.88\n986\t      - 0.87\n987\t      - 0.78\n988\t      - 0.73\n989\t    - - Min-K%++\n990\t      - token probs\n991\t      - 0.83\n992\t      - 0.94\n993\t      - 0.93\n994\t      - 0.92\n995\t      - 0.88\n996\t      - 0.84\n997\t    note: ConStat requires generating rephrased items + re-evaluating model. Min-K%++\n998\t      requires token-level log-probabilities.\n999\t  - name: 'Table: Power-Information Frontier'\n1000\t    columns:\n1001\t    - method\n1002\t    - information_access\n1003\t    - applicability\n1004\t    - mean_auroc_at_15pct\n1005\t    - unique_capability\n1006\t    rows:\n1007\t    - - IRT-FIT\n1008\t      - 'Level 1: binary responses'\n1009\t      - any model with benchmark scores\n1010\t      - 0.72\n1011\t      - retrospective audit of historical submissions\n1012\t    - - ConStat\n1013\t      - 'Level 2: binary + rephrased retest'\n1014\t      - live model access required\n1015\t      - 0.84\n1016\t      - direct contamination vs memorization distinction\n1017\t    - - Min-K%++\n1018\t      - 'Level 3: token probabilities'\n1019\t      - API with logprobs\n1020\t      - 0.9\n1021\t      - per-item contamination scoring\n1022\t  figures_description:\n1023\t  - 'Fig: Power-information frontier plot — x-axis = information access level (ordinal:\n1024\t    binary < retest < token probs < logits < weights), y-axis = mean AUROC at 15%\n1025\t    contamination. IRT-FIT defines the leftmost (minimal-information) point. Clear\n1026\t    monotone increasing trend. Annotated with each method''s applicability scope (number\n1027\t    of models testable).'\n1028\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves for all three methods on MMLU@15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve\n1029\t    clearly below but meaningfully above chance. Gap most visible in the low-FPR region\n1030\t    (0-0.1 FPR).'\n1031\t  analysis: 'Baseline comparison 确认了 minimal-information 的代价是可量化的 ~13pp AUROC gap\n1032\t    vs ConStat。 这是论文的 honest framing 而非 weakness：IRT-FIT 不是要 beat baselines， 而是要定义\n1033\t    detection frontier 的 minimal-information 端点，并量化 \"如果你只有 binary responses，你能做到什么\"。\n1034\t    Power-information frontier 图将成为论文的 signature figure。\n1035\t\n1036\t    '\n1037\t- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n1038\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n1039\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n1040\t    提供模型级整体污染指标。\n1041\t\n1042\t    '\n1043\t  expected_results:\n1044\t    lzm_formula: lzm = Σ_b w_b × lz*_b / sqrt(Σ_b w_b²) where w_b = 1/SE(lz*_b)\n1045\t    lzm_gemini15: 3.82\n1046\t    lzm_gpt4o: 2.15\n1047\t    lzm_claude35_sonnet: 1.89\n1048\t    lzm_qwen25_72b: 1.74\n1049\t    lzm_llama31_70b: 1.42\n1050\t    lzm_mean: 2.05\n1051\t    lzm_sd: 0.78\n1052\t    cross_bench_consistency_before_lzm: 0.35\n1053\t    cross_bench_consistency_after_lzm: N/A (lzm is a single score)\n1054\t    lzm_vs_mean_lz_star_correlation: 0.91\n1055\t    lzm_incremental_value_over_mean: moderate — proper variance weighting helps for\n1056\t      unequal benchmark sizes\n1057\t    lzm_auroc_ctrl_15pct: 0.82\n1058\t    lzm_vs_best_single_benchmark_auroc: +0.03 over MMLU alone\n1059\t    lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: 4/12 models (Gemini-1.5, GPT-4o, model_X, model_Y)\n1060\t  result_rationale: \"Multiscale lzm 通过 inverse-variance weighting 聚合跨 benchmark 的\\\n1061\t    \\ lz*， 理论上应该提高检测力（多个弱信号的联合强于任何单一信号）。\\n在 median 档下，改善是\\\"moderate\\\"而非 dramatic：\\\n1062\t    \\ - lzm AUROC 0.82 仅比最佳单 benchmark (MMLU, 0.79) 高 3pp，\\n  因为 MMLU 的 weight 最大（n=14K,\\\n1063\t    \\ SE 最小），其他 benchmark 贡献有限。\\n- 小 benchmark (ARC-C, HumanEval) 因 SE 大，在 lzm 中几乎被\\\n1064\t    \\ downweight 到 negligible。\\nlzm 与简单 mean(lz*) 的相关性 0.91，表明 variance weighting\\\n1065\t    \\ 的增量价值有限 但在 benchmark 大小差异极端时（14K vs 164 items）理论上更 principled。\\n实际价值更多是方法论的完整性——展示\\\n1066\t    \\ IRT person-fit 框架可以 naturally  扩展到 multi-test setting，而非提供显著的 practical improvement。\\n\"\n1067\t  tables:\n1068\t  - name: 'Table: lzm Scores for Phase B Models (Top 6)'\n1069\t    columns:\n1070\t    - model\n1071\t    - lzm\n1072\t    - rank\n1073\t    - mmlu_lz_star\n1074\t    - hellaswag_lz_star\n1075\t    - gsm8k_lz_star\n1076\t    - interpretation\n1077\t    rows:\n1078\t    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n1079\t      - 3.82\n1080\t      - 1\n1081\t      - 31.8\n1082\t      - 28.4\n1083\t      - 15.2\n1084\t      - strongest overall aberrance\n1085\t    - - GPT-4o\n1086\t      - 2.15\n1087\t      - 2\n1088\t      - 22.5\n1089\t      - 18.9\n1090\t      - 9.8\n1091\t      - moderate aberrance\n1092\t    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n1093\t      - 1.89\n1094\t      - 3\n1095\t      - 20.1\n1096\t      - 17.2\n1097\t      - 8.5\n1098\t      - moderate\n1099\t    - - Qwen2.5-72B\n1100\t      - 1.74\n1101\t      - 4\n1102\t      - 19.8\n1103\t      - 15.1\n1104\t      - 7.2\n1105\t      - moderate\n1106\t    - - LLaMA-3.1-70B\n1107\t      - 1.42\n1108\t      - 5\n1109\t      - 16.2\n1110\t      - 14.8\n1111\t      - 6.1\n1112\t      - low-moderate\n1113\t    - - '[smallest model]'\n1114\t      - 0.45\n1115\t      - 12\n1116\t      - 5.2\n1117\t      - 3.8\n1118\t      - 2.1\n1119\t      - low\n1120\t  figures_description:\n1121\t  - 'Fig: lzm distribution across 12 Phase B models — histogram with Gemini-1.5 as\n1122\t    clear outlier. Dashed line at lzm=1.96 (theoretical threshold). Most models above\n1123\t    threshold due to universal misfit, but Gemini-1.5 far above the rest.'\n1124\t  analysis: 'lzm 提供了一个 principled single-number 污染指标，但在 median 档下 增量检测力有限（+3pp AUROC）。其价值更多是概念性的——完成了从\n1125\t    single-benchmark lz* 到 model-level assessment 的理论扩展。 适合放在论文中作为 methodology contribution，但不应作为主要\n1126\t    selling point。\n1127\t\n1128\t    '\n1129\t- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test\n1130\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n1131\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 信号在 RL 后是否保留。 回应 Wang\n1132\t    et al. (2025)。\n1133\t\n1134\t    '\n1135\t  expected_results:\n1136\t    pre_rl_lz_star: 23.8\n1137\t    pre_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.78\n1138\t    pre_rl_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n1139\t    post_rl_lz_star: 21.1\n1140\t    post_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.8\n1141\t    post_rl_delta_lz_star: 2.6\n1142\t    post_rl_signal_retention: 0.49\n1143\t    post_rl_still_detectable: marginal (p=0.08)\n1144\t    clean_post_rl_lz_star: 19.2\n1145\t    clean_post_rl_accuracy: 0.74\n1146\t    clean_post_rl_delta_from_clean_pre_rl: 0.7\n1147\t    signal_attenuation_pct: 51\n1148\t    rl_smoothing_effect: GRPO redistributes probability mass, partially smoothing\n1149\t      aberrant item-level patterns\n1150\t    detection_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.65\n1151\t    detection_auroc_pre_rl_15pct: 0.79\n1152\t  result_rationale: 'Wang et al. (2025) 证明 RL (PPO/DPO) 后 MIA-based 方法（Min-K%++ 等）检测力\n1153\t    大幅下降——因为 RL 重新分配了 token-level 概率分布，抹去了 memorization 的  token-level 签名。\n1154\t\n1155\t    IRT-FIT 操作在 binary response level，理论上对 token-level 变化更 robust—— 只要模型仍然在不该答对的题目上答对，lz*\n1156\t    就会偏离。但 GRPO 也会部分 平滑 item-level patterns：(1) RL reward 通常基于 overall task performance  而非单\n1157\t    item accuracy，鼓励模型\"均匀化\"知识分布；(2) policy gradient 更新 可能让模型遗忘一些 SFT 过拟合的特定 items。\n1158\t\n1159\t    Median 档预测：信号衰减约 50%（5.3 → 2.6 Δlz*），marginal detection (p=0.08)。 不像 MIA 方法完全失败，但也不能声称\"robust\n1160\t    to RL\"。 这符合\"medium effect, conditional detection\"的整体 narrative。 AUROC 从 0.79 降到\n1161\t    0.65——仍然 above chance 但不再 reliable。\n1162\t\n1163\t    '\n1164\t  tables:\n1165\t  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n1166\t    columns:\n1167\t    - condition\n1168\t    - accuracy\n1169\t    - lz_star\n1170\t    - delta_lz_star_from_clean\n1171\t    - detection_p\n1172\t    - auroc\n1173\t    rows:\n1174\t    - - Clean (pre-RL)\n1175\t      - 0.71\n1176\t      - 18.5\n1177\t      - —\n1178\t      - —\n1179\t      - —\n1180\t    - - Clean (post-RL)\n1181\t      - 0.74\n1182\t      - 19.2\n1183\t      - 0.7\n1184\t      - 0.42\n1185\t      - 0.53\n1186\t    - - Contaminated 15% (pre-RL)\n1187\t      - 0.78\n1188\t      - 23.8\n1189\t      - 5.3\n1190\t      - 0.028\n1191\t      - 0.79\n1192\t    - - Contaminated 15% (post-RL)\n1193\t      - 0.8\n1194\t      - 21.1\n1195\t      - 2.6\n1196\t      - 0.08\n1197\t      - 0.65\n1198\t    note: 'GRPO training: 3 epochs, reward = accuracy on held-out reasoning tasks.\n1199\t      Signal retention = post-RL delta / pre-RL delta = 49%.'\n1200\t  figures_description:\n1201\t  - 'Fig: Signal attenuation trajectory — lz* over RL training steps (0, 500, 1000,\n1202\t    2000, 5000 steps) for contaminated (red) and clean (blue) models. Gap narrows\n1203\t    progressively. Annotated with AUROC at each checkpoint.'\n1204\t  analysis: 'Post-RL 信号衰减 ~50% 是一个 nuanced result：优于 MIA 方法的\"完全失败\" 但不能声称 robust。论文应这样\n1205\t    frame：\"IRT-FIT 的 binary-level 操作比 token-level  方法更 resilient to RL smoothing，但\n1206\t    post-RL detection 仍然是一个 open challenge。\" Priority P2 合理——这是一个重要的 discussion point\n1207\t    但不是核心贡献。\n1208\t\n1209\t    '\n1210\t- name: Extended Benchmarks — BBH and MATH\n1211\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n1212\t  description: '添加 BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n1213\t\n1214\t    '\n1215\t  expected_results:\n1216\t    bbh_4pl_params_available: partial — PSN-IRT may have BBH but needs verification\n1217\t    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n1218\t    bbh_sim_power_5pct: 0.18\n1219\t    bbh_inverted_u_r2: 0.82\n1220\t    bbh_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n1221\t    math_4pl_params_available: likely not in PSN-IRT; may need calibration\n1222\t    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.65\n1223\t    math_sim_power_5pct: 0.14\n1224\t    math_inverted_u_r2: 0.79\n1225\t    math_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.67\n1226\t    power_curve_r2_with_bbh_math: 0.93\n1227\t    power_curve_r2_without: 0.88\n1228\t    n_items_threshold_confirmation: ≥5K items needed for AUROC>0.65 at 15%\n1229\t  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 恰好落在 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag\n1230\t    (10042)  之间，填补了 power curve 中 1K-10K 区间的数据空白。\n1231\t\n1232\t    BBH 预期 power 0.72——接近 HellaSwag (0.733) 因为 item 数接近， 但 BBH 的 item 结构不同（多步推理题），可能导致\n1233\t    4PL 拟合更差。 MATH 预期 power 0.65——处于 GSM8K 和 BBH 之间。\n1234\t\n1235\t    这两个 benchmark 的加入主要价值是让 power vs n_items 曲线拟合更精确 （R² 从 0.88 提升到 0.93），加强了 \"n_items\n1236\t    threshold\" 的理论论证。 但 4PL 参数可用性是风险点——如果 PSN-IRT 没有这些 benchmark 的参数， 需要自己校准，GPU 预算可能显著增加。\n1237\t\n1238\t    '\n1239\t  tables:\n1240\t  - name: 'Table: Power Curve Data Points (Complete)'\n1241\t    columns:\n1242\t    - benchmark\n1243\t    - n_items\n1244\t    - sim_power@15%\n1245\t    - ctrl_auroc@15%\n1246\t    - source\n1247\t    rows:\n1248\t    - - HumanEval\n1249\t      - 164\n1250\t      - 0.243\n1251\t      - 0.54\n1252\t      - existing\n1253\t    - - ARC-C\n1254\t      - 1172\n1255\t      - 0.129\n1256\t      - 0.58\n1257\t      - existing\n1258\t    - - GSM8K\n1259\t      - 1319\n1260\t      - 0.578\n1261\t      - 0.63\n1262\t      - existing\n1263\t    - - MATH\n1264\t      - 5000\n1265\t      - 0.65\n1266\t      - 0.67\n1267\t      - new\n1268\t    - - BBH\n1269\t      - 6511\n1270\t      - 0.72\n1271\t      - 0.71\n1272\t      - new\n1273\t    - - HellaSwag\n1274\t      - 10042\n1275\t      - 0.733\n1276\t      - 0.74\n1277\t      - existing\n1278\t    - - MMLU\n1279\t      - 14042\n1280\t      - 0.979\n1281\t      - 0.79\n1282\t      - existing\n1283\t    note: ARC-C power anomalously low for its n_items — item parameter distribution\n1284\t      (narrow difficulty range) reduces effective information.\n1285\t  figures_description:\n1286\t  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks. Log-x scale. Fitted theoretical\n1287\t    curve (from exp-power-theory) with confidence band. BBH and MATH points fall within\n1288\t    prediction interval, confirming the theoretical relationship.'\n1289\t  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 加强了 power-n_items 关系的实证支撑，使\"≥5K items for reliable detection\"\n1290\t    的 claim 更可信。但如果 4PL 参数需要自行校准，优先级应保持 P2—— 这是 nice-to-have 而非 essential。\n1291\t\n1292\t    '\n1293\t- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n1294\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n1295\t  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面性还是集中性。\n1296\t\n1297\t    '\n1298\t  expected_results:\n1299\t    n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n1300\t    n_subjects_with_sufficient_items: 42\n1301\t    min_items_per_subject_threshold: 100\n1302\t    gemini15_n_subjects_flagged: 38\n1303\t    gemini15_flagged_rate: 0.9\n1304\t    gemini15_domain_lz_star_mean: 5.2\n1305\t    gemini15_domain_lz_star_sd: 2.8\n1306\t    gemini15_top_aberrant_domains:\n1307\t    - abstract_algebra (lz*=9.1)\n1308\t    - college_mathematics (lz*=8.7)\n1309\t    - formal_logic (lz*=8.3)\n1310\t    gemini15_least_aberrant_domains:\n1311\t    - high_school_us_history (lz*=1.2)\n1312\t    - world_religions (lz*=1.5)\n1313\t    gemini15_stem_vs_humanities_lz_star_diff: 2.1\n1314\t    gemini15_contamination_pattern: broad but STEM-concentrated\n1315\t    other_models_domain_concentration_gini: 0.45\n1316\t    domain_specificity_varies_by_model: true\n1317\t  result_rationale: 'Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 100% accuracy + lz*=34.75 + θ=0.78 表明大规模污染。\n1318\t    Domain-level 分析可以区分：(1) 均匀污染（所有 subject 同样 aberrant）vs  (2) 集中污染（某些 domain 远比其他更\n1319\t    aberrant）。\n1320\t\n1321\t    预测 Gemini-1.5 是\"broad but STEM-concentrated\"——90% 的 subjects 被标记 表明污染覆盖面广，但 STEM\n1322\t    domains（数学、逻辑）的 lz* 更高， 可能因为这些 domain 的 item difficulty 分布更极端（有更多真正 hard items），\n1323\t    污染导致的 aberrance 更显著。文科 domain 的 items 整体较易， 即使没有污染高能力模型也能做对大多数，aberrance 信号更弱。\n1324\t\n1325\t    Gini 系数 0.45 表明中等集中度——不完全均匀但也非极端集中。 这与\"SFT 在完整 MMLU 上训练\"的假说一致——训练覆盖所有 subject，\n1326\t    但不同 subject 的检测灵敏度取决于 item difficulty 分布。\n1327\t\n1328\t    '\n1329\t  tables:\n1330\t  - name: 'Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain Analysis (Top/Bottom 5)'\n1331\t    columns:\n1332\t    - domain\n1333\t    - n_items\n1334\t    - accuracy\n1335\t    - lz_star\n1336\t    - flagged\n1337\t    rows:\n1338\t    - - abstract_algebra\n1339\t      - 100\n1340\t      - 1.0\n1341\t      - 9.1\n1342\t      - 'yes'\n1343\t    - - college_mathematics\n1344\t      - 100\n1345\t      - 1.0\n1346\t      - 8.7\n1347\t      - 'yes'\n1348\t    - - formal_logic\n1349\t      - 126\n1350\t      - 1.0\n1351\t      - 8.3\n1352\t      - 'yes'\n1353\t    - - college_physics\n1354\t      - 102\n1355\t      - 1.0\n1356\t      - 7.9\n1357\t      - 'yes'\n1358\t    - - electrical_engineering\n1359\t      - 145\n1360\t      - 1.0\n1361\t      - 7.5\n1362\t      - 'yes'\n1363\t    - - '...'\n1364\t      - '...'\n1365\t      - '...'\n1366\t      - '...'\n1367\t      - '...'\n1368\t    - - world_religions\n1369\t      - 171\n1370\t      - 1.0\n1371\t      - 1.5\n1372\t      - 'no'\n1373\t    - - high_school_us_history\n1374\t      - 204\n1375\t      - 1.0\n1376\t      - 1.2\n1377\t      - 'no'\n1378\t  figures_description:\n1379\t  - 'Fig: MMLU domain-level lz* heatmap for Gemini-1.5 — 57 subjects sorted by lz*.\n1380\t    Color gradient from white (low aberrance) to dark red (high aberrance). STEM cluster\n1381\t    visually prominent. Superimposed: mean item difficulty per subject (blue line)\n1382\t    showing correlation with lz*.'\n1383\t  - 'Fig: STEM vs Humanities lz* boxplots for Gemini-1.5, showing significant difference\n1384\t    (p<0.01). Other models shown as gray background for comparison — most show no\n1385\t    STEM/Humanities lz* difference.'\n1386\t  analysis: Domain analysis 为 Gemini-1.5 case study 增加了 granularity——不仅是\"flagged\"，\n1387\t    而是\"STEM-concentrated broad contamination\"。这在论文中可以用 1-2 段讨论， 展示 IRT-FIT 的 diagnostic\n1388\t    能力不仅限于 binary flagging。 但因为只有 Gemini-1.5 有 100% accuracy（其他模型无此极端 pattern）， 这个分析的\n1389\t    generalizability 有限。\n1390\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7fb9d8d-04d9-47f4-8cd0-9727cb82002c","uuid":"d07419a8-ae53-4a51-bbb8-0d78d8302a8b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:10:58.152Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T092614/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claims 需要 scope 收窄但核心 framing 保留。Claim 1 调整为条件式检测能力声明——大 benchmark\n  + 中高污染有效， minimal-info 代价可量化。Claim 2 保留 inverted-U 但增加 boundary condition。Claim\n  3 缩小 audit 规模， Gemini-1.5 作为 converging evidence。论文定位从 practical detector 转向 principled\n  framework with characterized operating envelope。Power-information tradeoff 的量化本身成为贡献。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Extended Simulation — High Contamination & Inverted-U Characterization\n  plan_id: exp-extended-sim\n  description: '扩展 Phase A 模拟至 60%/75%/90%/100% contamination，修复 100% boundary 处理，\n    刻画 inverted-U 拐点位置，计算 two-sided power curves。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mmlu_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.979\n    mmlu_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.68\n    mmlu_power_neg_at_75pct: 0.22\n    mmlu_power_neg_at_90pct: 0.04\n    mmlu_power_pos_at_60pct: 0.12\n    mmlu_power_pos_at_75pct: 0.41\n    mmlu_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.73\n    mmlu_power_pos_at_100pct: 0.88\n    mmlu_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n    mmlu_crossover_point: 0.58\n    hellaswag_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.733\n    hellaswag_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.52\n    hellaswag_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.61\n    hellaswag_inverted_u_peak_contam: 0.15\n    gsm8k_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.578\n    gsm8k_power_neg_at_50pct: 0.38\n    gsm8k_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.42\n    arc_c_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.129\n    arc_c_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.31\n    humaneval_power_neg_at_15pct: 0.243\n    humaneval_power_pos_at_90pct: 0.18\n    inverted_u_r2_mmlu: 0.88\n    inverted_u_r2_hellaswag: 0.84\n    inverted_u_r2_gsm8k: 0.79\n    inverted_u_r2_arc_c: 0.76\n    inverted_u_r2_humaneval: 0.72\n    inverted_u_mean_r2: 0.8\n    mmlu_twosided_power_at_15pct: 0.979\n    mmlu_twosided_power_at_50pct: 0.68\n    mmlu_twosided_power_at_75pct: 0.41\n    mmlu_twosided_power_at_90pct: 0.73\n    mmlu_twosided_power_at_100pct: 0.88\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 inverted-U 结构清晰存在但 transition zone (40%-70%) 出现 detection\n    gap—— 负向信号衰减但正向信号尚未建立，形成 ~30pp 的 power trough。这是因为中度污染同时 提升了 ability estimate\n    θ（减少 aberrance）又未达到完全一致（lz*>>0 需要几乎所有 item  都被预知）。MMLU 因 n=14K items 保持全程最强检测力，inverted-U\n    R² 接近 0.9； 小 benchmark（ARC-C, HumanEval）因 lz* 方差大，inverted-U 拟合噪声更多，R² 降至 0.72-0.76。\n    100% contamination 在 θ=4.0 boundary 处理后可计算，lz* 显著为正但受 boundary 效应影响 不如理论预期极端。整体\n    inverted-U mean R² = 0.80 落在 tier 指标范围 [0.75, 0.90] 中段。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Two-Sided Power Matrix (Simulation)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - power@5%\n    - power@15%\n    - power@50%\n    - power@75%\n    - power@90%\n    - power@100%\n    - peak_contam\n    - crossover\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.88\n      - 15%\n      - 58%\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.78\n      - 15%\n      - 55%\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.51\n      - 10-15%\n      - 52%\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 1172\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.13\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.39\n      - 25-50%\n      - 65%\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.15\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.22\n      - 15%\n      - N/A\n    note: Power = max(P(lz*<-1.96), P(lz*>+1.96)) at each contamination level. Two-sided\n      combined.\n  - name: 'Table: Inverted-U Curve Parameters'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - peak_neg_power\n    - trough_power\n    - trough_contam_range\n    - recovery_power_at_100pct\n    - R2_fit\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.41\n      - 70-80%\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.88\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.33\n      - 65-80%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.84\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.24\n      - 60-80%\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.79\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.129\n      - 0.13\n      - 15-50%\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.76\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.09\n      - 60-85%\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.72\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Inverted-U power curves per benchmark (x=contamination%, y=detection power),\n    showing negative-side (blue, dashed) and positive-side (red, dashed) power separately,\n    plus two-sided envelope (black, solid). Shaded gray band marks the detection trough\n    zone. MMLU curve clearly U-shaped; HumanEval curve nearly flat with wide confidence\n    bands.'\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap of detection power (contamination level × benchmark), color-coded\n    green (>0.8) / yellow (0.5-0.8) / red (<0.5). Clear diagonal pattern: large benchmarks\n    green at moderate contamination, small benchmarks mostly red/yellow throughout.'\n  analysis: 'Inverted-U 在 MMLU 和 HellaSwag 上结构清晰——峰值在 15% 左右，trough 在 70-80%， 100%\n    恢复至 0.78-0.88。但小 benchmark 的 inverted-U 更像一条低矮的丘陵而非清晰的 U 型。 这为 Claim 2 提供支持但需要加\n    boundary condition：inverted-U 的理论形状成立， 但只有 n_items ≥ 5K 时 peak power 才超过 0.7，使检测具有实际意义。\n    Detection trough（40-70%）是一个必须在论文中诚实报告的盲区。\n\n    '\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot — Go/No-Go\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz* 是否显著。 论文 go/no-go\n    决策点。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_clean_mmlu_accuracy: 0.71\n    qwen_clean_mmlu_theta: 1.05\n    qwen_clean_mmlu_lz_star: 18.5\n    qwen_15pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.78\n    qwen_15pct_mmlu_theta: 1.42\n    qwen_15pct_mmlu_lz_star: 23.8\n    qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n    qwen_15pct_delta_lz_star_cohen_d: 1.2\n    qwen_15pct_delta_accuracy: 0.07\n    qwen_50pct_mmlu_accuracy: 0.89\n    qwen_50pct_mmlu_theta: 2.31\n    qwen_50pct_mmlu_lz_star: 14.2\n    qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star: -4.3\n    qwen_50pct_delta_lz_star_direction: decreased (toward normal or positive)\n    qwen_50pct_delta_accuracy: 0.18\n    ttest_clean_vs_15pct_p: 0.028\n    ttest_clean_vs_50pct_p: 0.11\n    bootstrap_ci_delta_15pct:\n    - 1.8\n    - 8.9\n    bootstrap_ci_delta_50pct:\n    - -9.1\n    - 0.5\n    go_signal: CONDITIONAL GO\n    go_signal_detail: Δlz* significant at 15% but inverted-U already visible at 50%\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：SFT 注入后 Δlz* 存在但效应量中等。Clean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上\n    已经有高 lz*（~18.5），因为所有 LLM 都违反 IRT 假设（Phase B 已证实 universal misfit）。 15% SFT 污染在\n    14K-item MMLU 上产生足够多的 aberrant responses——模型在本不该答对的 hard items（低 θ 区域）上答对，lz*\n    进一步偏离，Cohen''s d ~1.2 可检测。但 50% 污染 触发 inverted-U 效应：大量 item 被记忆后 θ 估计大幅上升（1.05→2.31），模型看起来\n    像一个\"真正高能力\"的 examinee，aberrance pattern 被 smoothed——lz* 反而回落甚至 可能低于 baseline。SFT\n    泛化效应（domain 内未直接训练 items 的准确率也提升）进一步 稀释了 aberrance 信号。这给出 conditional go：15% 有信号，但\n    50% 的 inverted-U 效应 意味着高污染检测需要依赖正向 lz* 阈值，而 50% 可能恰好落在 trough zone。 P 值在 15% 边缘显著（0.028），50%\n    不显著（0.11）——因为 Δ 方向反转且 variance 大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - accuracy\n    - theta\n    - lz_star\n    - delta_lz_star\n    - cohen_d\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - 0% (clean)\n      - 0.71\n      - 1.05\n      - 18.5\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 15%\n      - 0.78\n      - 1.42\n      - 23.8\n      - 5.3\n      - 1.2\n      - 0.028\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.89\n      - 2.31\n      - 14.2\n      - -4.3\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.11\n    note: lz* computed with benchmark-specific θ and bootstrap (n=1000). Cohen's d\n      = |Δlz*| / pooled_sd across 3 random seeds.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart with 3 conditions (clean/15%/50%), y-axis = lz*, error bars =\n    bootstrap 95% CI. Shows non-monotonic pattern: lz* rises at 15% then drops at\n    50%, illustrating inverted-U in real SFT data.'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of per-subject accuracy delta (y) vs per-subject lz* delta\n    (x) at 15% contamination. Shows that subjects with largest accuracy gains also\n    have largest lz* increase — contamination signal is concentrated in directly trained\n    domains.'\n  analysis: 'Pilot 给出 conditional go。15% 的 Δlz* = +5.3 (Cohen''s d = 1.2) 在 MMLU 上显著，\n    证明 SFT 污染可被 person-fit 检测。但 50% 的信号反转确认了 inverted-U 在真实 SFT 数据中 存在，且 trough 比模拟更早出现（模拟中\n    trough 在 70-80%，实际 50% 已开始回落）， 可能因为 SFT 泛化效应（domain-level accuracy boost）提前了 θ\n    上升。 Go/no-go 判定：GO，但需要在完整实验中加入 25% 污染水平以精确定位 real-data inverted-U peak。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B × 6 contamination levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%)\n    × 5 benchmarks。 建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 完整映射。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 18.5\n    qwen_mmlu_5pct_lz_star: 19.8\n    qwen_mmlu_5pct_delta: 1.3\n    qwen_mmlu_5pct_cohen_d: 0.3\n    qwen_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.58\n    qwen_mmlu_10pct_lz_star: 21.6\n    qwen_mmlu_10pct_delta: 3.1\n    qwen_mmlu_10pct_cohen_d: 0.7\n    qwen_mmlu_10pct_auroc: 0.68\n    qwen_mmlu_15pct_lz_star: 23.8\n    qwen_mmlu_15pct_delta: 5.3\n    qwen_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 1.2\n    qwen_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.79\n    qwen_mmlu_25pct_lz_star: 22.1\n    qwen_mmlu_25pct_delta: 3.6\n    qwen_mmlu_25pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n    qwen_mmlu_25pct_auroc: 0.72\n    qwen_mmlu_50pct_lz_star: 14.2\n    qwen_mmlu_50pct_delta: -4.3\n    qwen_mmlu_50pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n    qwen_mmlu_50pct_auroc: 0.64\n    qwen_hellaswag_clean_lz_star: 15.2\n    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.8\n    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.9\n    qwen_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.74\n    qwen_hellaswag_5pct_auroc: 0.55\n    qwen_gsm8k_clean_lz_star: 6.1\n    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_delta: 1.9\n    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_cohen_d: 0.6\n    qwen_gsm8k_15pct_auroc: 0.63\n    qwen_gsm8k_5pct_auroc: 0.52\n    qwen_arcc_clean_lz_star: 4.8\n    qwen_arcc_15pct_delta: 1.1\n    qwen_arcc_15pct_cohen_d: 0.4\n    qwen_arcc_15pct_auroc: 0.58\n    qwen_arcc_5pct_auroc: 0.51\n    qwen_humaneval_clean_lz_star: 2.3\n    qwen_humaneval_15pct_delta: 0.6\n    qwen_humaneval_15pct_cohen_d: 0.2\n    qwen_humaneval_15pct_auroc: 0.54\n    gemma_mmlu_clean_lz_star: 22.1\n    gemma_mmlu_15pct_delta: 4.1\n    gemma_mmlu_15pct_cohen_d: 0.95\n    gemma_mmlu_15pct_auroc: 0.76\n    gemma_mmlu_5pct_auroc: 0.56\n    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_delta: 3.2\n    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_cohen_d: 0.8\n    gemma_hellaswag_15pct_auroc: 0.71\n    cross_model_delta_direction_agreement_15pct: 5/5 benchmarks same direction\n    cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_mmlu: 1.29\n    cross_model_delta_magnitude_ratio_hellaswag: 1.19\n    cross_model_spearman_delta_across_benchmarks: 0.7\n    sft_generalization_domain_accuracy_boost: 0.03\n    sft_generalization_nontrained_item_accuracy_delta: 0.02\n    n_conditions_auroc_above_0.7: 4/12 (MMLU×2models + HellaSwag×2models at 15%)\n    n_conditions_auroc_above_0.8: 0/12\n    overall_detection_threshold: ≥15% contamination AND ≥5K items\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档的核心预测：Cohen''s d 在 0.8-2.0 之间，仅 ≥15% + ≥5K items 可靠分离。\n\n    5% 污染检测力不足（AUROC < 0.70）——因为 5% 对应 MMLU 仅 ~700 items 被记忆， 产生的 aberrant pattern\n    在 14K-item 的 lz* 计算中被 noise 淹没。SFT 泛化效应 使未直接训练的同 domain items 也提升了 ~2-3pp 准确率，进一步稀释信号。\n\n    15% 是 sweet spot——~2100 items 产生足够 aberrance，且 θ 尚未被推高到  identifiability collapse\n    区域。但即使在 MMLU 上 AUROC 也只有 0.79 而非 0.95+， 因为 baseline lz* 已经很高（~18.5），Δlz* = 5.3\n    相对于 baseline variance 只是中等效应。\n\n    25% 开始出现 inverted-U 衰减——θ 上升使部分 hard items 变得\"合理答对\"， aberrance 减少。50% 信号反转。\n\n    小 benchmark（ARC-C 1172 items, HumanEval 164 items）在所有污染水平下 都无法可靠检测——lz* 的 sampling\n    variance 与 n_items^(-1/2) 成正比， 164 items 的 SE 比 14K items 大 ~9 倍。\n\n    跨模型方向一致（两个模型在 5/5 benchmarks 上 Δlz* 同向），但幅度差异 20-30%——Gemma-4-31B baseline 更强（θ\n    更高），留给污染信号的\"空间\"更小。 这符合 tier 预测的\"方向一致但幅度差异大\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: AUROC by Contamination Level × Benchmark (Qwen3.5-9B)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - AUROC@5%\n    - AUROC@10%\n    - AUROC@15%\n    - AUROC@25%\n    - AUROC@50%\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.64\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.59\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.57\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.55\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 1172\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.53\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.51\n    note: AUROC computed over 3 seeds per condition. Chance = 0.50.\n  - name: 'Table: Cohen''s d at 15% Contamination — Cross-Model Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - qwen_d\n    - gemma_d\n    - direction_agree\n    - magnitude_ratio\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 1.2\n      - 0.95\n      - 'yes'\n      - 1.26\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.8\n      - 'yes'\n      - 1.13\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.5\n      - 'yes'\n      - 1.2\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.3\n      - 'yes'\n      - 1.33\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.15\n      - 'yes'\n      - 1.33\n  - name: 'Table: SFT Generalization Analysis (Qwen3.5-9B, MMLU, 15%)'\n    columns:\n    - item_category\n    - n_items\n    - accuracy_clean\n    - accuracy_contam\n    - delta_acc\n    - delta_lz_star_contribution\n    rows:\n    - - Directly trained items\n      - 2106\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.29\n      - dominant signal source\n    - - Same-domain untrained\n      - 4200\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.03\n      - noise / dilution\n    - - Other-domain items\n      - 7736\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.01\n      - negligible\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Δlz* dose-response curves for both models × MMLU. X-axis = contamination\n    level, Y-axis = Δlz* from clean baseline. Inverted-U clearly visible: peak at\n    15-25%, crossing zero around 40-50%. Qwen curve consistently above Gemma by ~1-2\n    lz* units. Error bars (3 seeds) overlap at 5% and 50% but separate at 15%.'\n  - 'Fig: AUROC heatmap (contamination level × benchmark × model). 2×5×5 grid. Only\n    the top-left quadrant (≥15% × ≥5K items) is green (>0.70). Strong diagonal gradient\n    from top-left to bottom-right.'\n  - 'Fig: Per-item analysis at 15% contamination — scatter of item difficulty (b parameter)\n    vs P(correct|contaminated) - P(correct|clean). Directly trained items cluster\n    in high-difficulty, high-delta region. SFT generalization items show small diffuse\n    delta.'\n  analysis: '核心结论：IRT-FIT 在 controlled contamination 下给出 medium-effect detection，\n    operating envelope 为 ≥15% contamination + ≥5K items + negative-lz* regime。 这不是一个\n    practical detector（AUROC 未超过 0.80），但成功量化了 minimal-information  的代价——同样 ground-truth\n    数据上 ConStat 预期 AUROC 0.85-0.95（需 exp-baseline-comparison 确认）。 SFT 泛化效应是信号衰减的主要原因之一——约\n    3pp 的 domain-level accuracy boost  让 ~30% 的非训练 items 也被答对，稀释了 aberrance pattern。\n    论文需要诚实报告 operating envelope 并将 power-information tradeoff 作为核心贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: Theoretical Power Derivation\n  plan_id: exp-power-theory\n  description: '基于 Snijders (2001) lz* 方差公式推导 power ∝ f(n_items, contam_rate) 的解析关系，\n    验证理论曲线与模拟的拟合度，建立 inverted-U 的理论基础。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theory_vs_sim_r2_negative_regime: 0.91\n    theory_vs_sim_r2_positive_regime: 0.83\n    theory_vs_sim_r2_combined: 0.85\n    min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_15pct: 8200\n    min_n_items_for_power_0.5_at_15pct: 2800\n    min_n_items_for_power_0.8_at_5pct: '>50000 (extrapolated)'\n    inverted_u_peak_formula: contam_peak ≈ σ²(θ) / (2 × E[I(θ)]) — depends on ability\n      variance and test information\n    inverted_u_peak_predicted_mmlu: 0.17\n    inverted_u_peak_observed_mmlu: 0.15\n    inverted_u_trough_depth_formula: proportional to n_items^(-1/2) × contam_rate\n      × (1 - contam_rate)\n    power_scaling: Power ∝ sqrt(n_items) × contam_rate × g(θ_shift) where g is a non-monotone\n      function capturing the inverted-U\n    identifiability_collapse_threshold: contam_rate at which E[θ_contam] > θ_max_discriminating\n      ≈ 3.0\n  result_rationale: 'Snijders (2001) 给出 Var(lz*) ≈ 1 + O(1/n) 在零假设下。污染注入等价于 向 response\n    vector 添加 n×c 个\"能力不匹配\"的正确回答（c = contamination rate）。\n\n    在负向 regime（低-中污染），lz* 的期望偏移 ∝ sqrt(n) × c × Σ[log P_j(θ) 的 aberrance term]， power\n    随 sqrt(n) 增长——这解释了为什么 MMLU (14K) 的 power 远超 ARC-C (1172)。 理论与模拟在负向 regime 拟合良好（R²\n    = 0.91），因为 Snijders 的正态近似在 大 n 下准确。\n\n    正向 regime 拟合较差（R² = 0.83）因为 identifiability collapse 涉及 θ 估计的 boundary 效应——当 θ\n    → ∞ 时 MLE 不稳定，理论公式的渐近近似失效。 这也是 median 档的体现：理论框架基本成立但在边界条件下精度降低。\n\n    min_n_items 阈值计算表明 5% 污染在任何现有 benchmark 上都不可检测 （需 >50K items），支持 \"scope 收窄\" 的叙事——IRT-FIT\n    不是万能探测器， 它在特定 operating envelope 内工作。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Theoretical vs Simulated Power'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - sim_power_15pct\n    - theory_power_15pct\n    - residual\n    - sim_power_5pct\n    - theory_power_5pct\n    - residual_5pct\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.03\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.75\n      - -0.017\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.02\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.1\n      - 0.01\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 1172\n      - 0.129\n      - 0.15\n      - -0.021\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.06\n      - -0.01\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.033\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.0\n    note: ARC-C 偏差大因为 item parameters 分布偏离理论假设（难度集中在窄范围）\n  - name: 'Table: Minimum n_items for Target Power'\n    columns:\n    - target_power\n    - contam_5pct\n    - contam_10pct\n    - contam_15pct\n    - contam_25pct\n    rows:\n    - - 0.5\n      - '>50K'\n      - 12000\n      - 2800\n      - 900\n    - - 0.8\n      - '>50K'\n      - 25000\n      - 8200\n      - 2200\n    - - 0.9\n      - '>50K'\n      - 40000\n      - 12500\n      - 3500\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power surface — 3D plot with axes (n_items, contamination_rate, power).\n    Theoretical surface in translucent blue, simulation data points as red dots. Good\n    agreement in the low-contamination quadrant, visible divergence at high-contamination\n    + small-n corner.'\n  - 'Fig: Inverted-U decomposition — theoretical curves showing negative-lz* contribution\n    (monotone decreasing in contam_rate) and positive-lz* contribution (monotone increasing),\n    with their sum producing the U shape. Annotated with the peak location formula.'\n  analysis: '理论推导成功建立了 power-n_items-contamination 的解析关系，inverted-U 从经验观察 升级为可推导的理论命题。关键贡献是\n    minimum n_items 表格——这给审稿人和用户一个 直接可用的查询工具。理论与模拟的 combined R² = 0.85 表明理论框架基本正确，\n    但需要承认在 identifiability collapse 附近的近似误差。 这是论文的一个坚实理论贡献，即使检测力本身是 medium。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Data Reconnaissance\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\n  description: '调研 HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 per-item binary response\n    data 可用性、格式、覆盖范围。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hf_results_repo_exists: true\n    per_item_binary_logs_available: partial\n    format: JSON with per-example predictions, not standardized across all models\n    n_models_total_in_leaderboard: 7000+\n    n_models_with_per_item_data: 280\n    n_models_with_complete_5benchmark_data: 150\n    benchmarks_covered:\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - ARC-C\n    - TruthfulQA\n    - Winogrande\n    - GSM8K\n    data_format_issues: variable JSON schema across submission dates; some models\n      only have aggregate scores; harness version differences (lm-eval v0.3 vs v0.4)\n    estimated_gpu_hours_to_supplement: 120\n    recommendation: proceed with 150-280 available models; supplement top-50 missing\n      flagships via inference\n  result_rationale: 'HuggingFace Open LLM Leaderboard v1（2023-2024 运行）使用 lm-evaluation-harness，\n    其结果存储在 open-llm-leaderboard-old/results repo 中。该 repo 包含 per-model  结果目录，但格式不统一——早期提交只有\n    aggregate JSON，后期版本包含 per-example logs。\n\n    Median 档预测 100-500 models 有 per-item data。实际可能约 280 个模型有可用的 per-item 级别数据，因为 lm-eval-harness\n    在某个版本后开始默认保存 per-example  predictions，但不是所有提交者都上传了完整日志。150 个模型有完整 5-benchmark\n    数据， 足够进行 IRT 参数估计和 person-fit 计算。\n\n    这是 median 档的典型场景——数据部分可用，需要工程投入去解析不统一的格式， 但不需要从零开始跑推理。280 个模型比 Phase B 的 12 个大\n    23 倍， 足以支撑 Claim 3 的 leaderboard audit，但无法声称是\"全面扫描\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Data Availability Summary'\n    columns:\n    - category\n    - count\n    - pct_of_total\n    - notes\n    rows:\n    - - Total models on leaderboard\n      - 7200\n      - 100%\n      - ''\n    - - Models with any results JSON\n      - 5800\n      - 80.6%\n      - some only aggregate\n    - - Models with per-item predictions\n      - 280\n      - 3.9%\n      - lm-eval ≥v0.4\n    - - Models with complete 5-bench per-item\n      - 150\n      - 2.1%\n      - usable for IRT-FIT\n    - - Top-50 flagships missing per-item\n      - 38\n      - —\n      - would need inference runs\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Timeline of per-item data availability on leaderboard — x-axis = submission\n    date, y-axis = cumulative models with per-item data. Sharp uptick after lm-eval\n    v0.4 release, plateau when leaderboard v1 closed.'\n  analysis: '280 models with per-item data 落在 tier 预测的 [100, 500] 范围内。 足够支撑 leaderboard\n    audit 但需要在论文中明确说明覆盖率限制。 建议策略：用 280 个可用模型做主分析，补充 top-50 缺失的旗舰模型（约 38 个需推理）， 总计\n    ~320 个模型。GPU 补充预算 ~20 hrs（38 models × ~0.5 hr each）可控。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard Audit — Large-Scale Person-Fit Scan\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: '对 ~280+ 可用模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit，绘制污染率趋势， 识别系统性异常模型。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_analyzed: 310\n    n_benchmarks: 5\n    total_model_benchmark_cells: 1550\n    flagged_rate_mmlu_delta_method: 0.22\n    flagged_rate_hellaswag_delta_method: 0.18\n    flagged_rate_gsm8k_delta_method: 0.28\n    flagged_rate_arcc_delta_method: 0.15\n    flagged_rate_humaneval_delta_method: 0.12\n    overall_flagged_rate: 0.19\n    n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 18\n    n_models_flagged_all_5: 3\n    top_flagged_model_1: Gemini-1.5-Pro (4/5 benchmarks, highest Δlz* on MMLU)\n    top_flagged_model_2: model_family_X (multiple sizes all flagged — systematic)\n    top_flagged_model_3: model_Y (GSM8K + MATH specialist, extreme negative lz* on\n      math benchmarks)\n    flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.12\n    flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.18\n    flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.25\n    temporal_trend_significant: true\n    temporal_trend_spearman: 0.38\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_hellaswag: 0.31\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_mmlu_gsm8k: 0.22\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_mean: 0.35\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_n_significant: 3/10 pairs\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档预测 leaderboard_flagged_rate_relative 在 [0.1, 0.4]，cross_benchmark_spearman  在\n    [0.3, 0.6]。\n\n    Overall flagged rate ~19% 反映了两个因素的叠加：(1) 确实存在的 benchmark gaming—— 开源社区中\"benchmark\n    hacking\"是公开的秘密，部分模型在 MMLU/GSM8K 训练集上做过 SFT； (2) Δlz* calibration 的不完美——controlled\n    experiment 建立的阈值基于 2 个模型， 可能对其他架构/训练策略不够 robust，产生一定 false positives。\n\n    时间趋势（12%→25%）有真实基础：2023 下半年到 2024 年，leaderboard 竞争加剧， 更多模型被发现在 benchmark data\n    上训练。但趋势的 effect size 中等（Spearman 0.38）， 因为早期模型中也有污染（只是比例低）且后期有些模型反而更注意避免。\n\n    Cross-benchmark 相关性弱到中等（mean 0.35）——这是 median 档的关键特征。 如果污染是系统性的（同一训练流程污染所有 benchmark），相关性应该高；\n    但实际上很多模型只在特定 benchmark 上有异常（如只刷 GSM8K 或只刷 MMLU）， 导致 per-benchmark 信号不一致。3/10 pairs\n    显著优于 Phase B 的 1/10， 但仍然不足以支撑\"全面跨 benchmark 一致性\"的强声明。\n\n    18 个模型在 3+ benchmarks 被标记——这些是最可信的 converging evidence cases， 论文应聚焦于这些而非整体 flagged\n    rate。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Leaderboard Flagged Rate by Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - n_models\n    - flagged_count\n    - flagged_rate\n    - median_delta_lz_star_flagged\n    - 95%CI_flagged_rate\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 310\n      - 68\n      - 0.22\n      - 4.8\n      - '[0.17, 0.27]'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 310\n      - 56\n      - 0.18\n      - 3.5\n      - '[0.14, 0.23]'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 310\n      - 87\n      - 0.28\n      - 2.1\n      - '[0.23, 0.33]'\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 1172\n      - 310\n      - 47\n      - 0.15\n      - 1.4\n      - '[0.11, 0.20]'\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 310\n      - 37\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.8\n      - '[0.08, 0.16]'\n    note: Flagging based on Δlz* > threshold calibrated from exp-ctrl-contam (15%\n      contamination boundary). GSM8K high rate may reflect both real contamination\n      AND low-n-items false positives.\n  - name: 'Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagged Models'\n    columns:\n    - n_benchmarks_flagged\n    - n_models\n    - example_models\n    rows:\n    - - 5\n      - 3\n      - Gemini-1.5-Pro, model_A, model_B\n    - - 4\n      - 7\n      - model_C, model_D, ...\n    - - 3\n      - 8\n      - model_E, model_F, ...\n    - - 2\n      - 23\n      - —\n    - - 1\n      - 18\n      - —\n    - - 0\n      - 251\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table: Temporal Contamination Trend'\n    columns:\n    - period\n    - n_models\n    - flagged_any\n    - flagged_rate\n    - flagged_≥3_bench\n    rows:\n    - - 2023 H1\n      - 85\n      - 10\n      - 0.12\n      - 1\n    - - 2023 H2\n      - 120\n      - 22\n      - 0.18\n      - 5\n    - - 2024 H1\n      - 105\n      - 26\n      - 0.25\n      - 12\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Leaderboard contamination landscape — scatter of models by (x=mean_accuracy,\n    y=mean_delta_lz_star), color-coded by number of benchmarks flagged (0=gray, 1=yellow,\n    2=orange, 3+=red). High-accuracy + high-Δlz* quadrant contains the most suspicious\n    models. Gemini-1.5 is an obvious outlier.'\n  - 'Fig: Temporal trend — stacked bar chart by submission half-year, showing flagged\n    (red) vs clean (gray) models. Increasing red proportion over time.'\n  - 'Fig: Cross-benchmark Δlz* correlation matrix (10 pairs), with significant correlations\n    highlighted. Mostly weak (0.2-0.4) with 3 significant pairs.'\n  analysis: 'Leaderboard audit 给出 median-range 结果：19% overall flagged rate，时间趋势存在但中等，\n    cross-benchmark 一致性弱。论文应采用保守叙事策略：聚焦于 18 个 multi-benchmark flagged  模型作为 high-confidence\n    cases，报告整体 flagged rate 作为 upper bound estimate， 明确说明 false positive rate 由 controlled\n    experiment calibration 的 transferability 限制。 Gemini-1.5 case study 从\"定义性证据\"降级为\"与\n    leaderboard-wide pattern 一致的 converging evidence\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) vs 3PL (d=1 fixed) 下 detection\n    sensitivity 差异。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.979\n    sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.952\n    sim_power_delta_mmlu: -0.027\n    sim_power_4pl_arcc_15pct: 0.129\n    sim_power_3pl_arcc_15pct: 0.108\n    sim_power_delta_arcc: -0.021\n    sim_fpr_4pl_alpha005: 0.048\n    sim_fpr_3pl_alpha005: 0.062\n    real_data_flagged_4pl: 57\n    real_data_flagged_3pl: 54\n    real_data_agreement: 52/60 cells agree\n    mean_d_across_benchmarks: 0.92\n    pct_items_d_lt_0.9: 0.31\n    d_impact_on_lz_star_correlation: 0.97\n  result_rationale: \"4PL 的 feasibility parameter d < 1 表示即使完全掌握 item 也无法保证答对 （如题目表述模糊或\\\n    \\ label 有误）。当 d 接近 1 时 4PL ≈ 3PL。\\nPSN-IRT 估计的平均 d = 0.92，说明大多数 items d 接近 1，\\\n    \\ 但有 ~31% 的 items d < 0.9（可能是有噪声的标注）。\\n在 median 档下，d 参数的影响是可测但不大的： - 4PL 的 lz*\\\n    \\ 对 high-ability examinees 更宽容（因为 d<1 意味着满分不太可能），\\n  这略微提高了检测灵敏度（~2-3pp power\\\n    \\ improvement）。\\n- 在 false alarm 控制上 4PL 更好（0.048 vs 0.062），因为 3PL 在 d<1 items\\\n    \\ 上\\n  会过度惩罚\\\"答错高概率题目\\\"的 pattern。\\n- 但整体差异不大：4PL vs 3PL 的 lz* 相关性 0.97，flagging\\\n    \\ 一致率 87%。\\n这个 ablation 的贡献是 confirming rather than surprising——4PL 略优但 3PL 也可用，\\\n    \\ 意味着方法对 item parameter 选择不过度敏感。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (Simulation)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - power_4PL@15%\n    - power_3PL@15%\n    - delta\n    - FPR_4PL\n    - FPR_3PL\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.952\n      - -0.027\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.062\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.711\n      - -0.022\n      - 0.045\n      - 0.058\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.559\n      - -0.019\n      - 0.051\n      - 0.065\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 0.129\n      - 0.108\n      - -0.021\n      - 0.049\n      - 0.067\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.228\n      - -0.015\n      - 0.052\n      - 0.061\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter of lz*_4PL vs lz*_3PL across all (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect\n    linear relationship (r=0.97) with slight divergence at extremes. Color-coded by\n    mean item d parameter of benchmark.'\n  analysis: '4PL 提供一致但微小的改进（~2-3pp power, ~1.5pp FPR reduction）。 足以证明 d 参数有理论和实证价值，但不是方法的核心驱动因素。\n    论文建议：主实验用 4PL，附录报告 3PL 结果作为 robustness check。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison — IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '在 controlled contamination ground-truth 上比较 IRT-FIT、ConStat、Min-K%++\n    的检测能力， 量化 minimal-information 的代价。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct: 0.79\n    auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct: 0.91\n    auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct: 0.94\n    auroc_gap_vs_constat_mmlu: -0.12\n    auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_mmlu: -0.15\n    auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_5pct: 0.58\n    auroc_constat_mmlu_5pct: 0.72\n    auroc_minkpp_mmlu_5pct: 0.83\n    auroc_irt_fit_hellaswag_15pct: 0.74\n    auroc_constat_hellaswag_15pct: 0.87\n    auroc_minkpp_hellaswag_15pct: 0.92\n    auroc_gap_vs_constat_hellaswag: -0.13\n    auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct: 0.63\n    auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct: 0.78\n    auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct: 0.88\n    auroc_gap_vs_constat_gsm8k: -0.15\n    mean_auroc_gap_vs_constat_at_15pct: -0.13\n    mean_auroc_gap_vs_minkpp_at_15pct: -0.16\n    type1_irt_fit: 0.06\n    type1_constat: 0.04\n    type1_minkpp: 0.03\n    info_irt_fit: binary responses only\n    info_constat: binary responses + rephrased retest\n    info_minkpp: token-level probabilities\n    pareto_optimal: Min-K%++ > ConStat > IRT-FIT in detection; IRT-FIT > ConStat >\n      Min-K%++ in applicability scope\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心预测：baseline_auroc_gap_vs_constat 在 [-0.20, -0.10]。\n\n    IRT-FIT AUROC 0.79 vs ConStat 0.91 (gap = -0.12) 在 MMLU@15% 符合预期。 ConStat 优势来自\n    rephrased retest 信号——如果模型记忆了原始 item， rephrased 版本的准确率会下降，这是一个直接的 contamination\n    indicator。 IRT-FIT 只能从 binary pattern 的 aberrance 间接推断，信息量先天不足。\n\n    Min-K%++ 的 AUROC 更高（0.94）因为 token-level probabilities 提供了 最丰富的信号——记忆的 item 有异常低的\n    token surprisal。\n\n    但信息需求也成比例增加：Min-K%++ 需要 API 返回 logprobs（很多 API 不支持）， ConStat 需要生成 rephrased items\n    并重新测试（需要 live model access）， IRT-FIT 只需要最终答案。在 Open LLM Leaderboard 这种场景下， 只有\n    IRT-FIT 可以对历史提交进行 retrospective analysis。\n\n    Gap = -0.12 to -0.15 是 minimal-information 的\"代价\"——论文将这个代价 本身作为贡献来量化和讨论，而非试图论证\n    IRT-FIT 性能优于 baselines。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Detection AUROC Comparison (Ground-Truth Controlled Contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_level\n    - MMLU@5%\n    - MMLU@15%\n    - MMLU@25%\n    - HellaSwag@15%\n    - GSM8K@15%\n    - ARC-C@15%\n    rows:\n    - - IRT-FIT (ours)\n      - binary only\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.58\n    - - ConStat\n      - binary + retest\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.73\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - token probs\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.84\n    note: ConStat requires generating rephrased items + re-evaluating model. Min-K%++\n      requires token-level log-probabilities.\n  - name: 'Table: Power-Information Frontier'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - information_access\n    - applicability\n    - mean_auroc_at_15pct\n    - unique_capability\n    rows:\n    - - IRT-FIT\n      - 'Level 1: binary responses'\n      - any model with benchmark scores\n      - 0.72\n      - retrospective audit of historical submissions\n    - - ConStat\n      - 'Level 2: binary + rephrased retest'\n      - live model access required\n      - 0.84\n      - direct contamination vs memorization distinction\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - 'Level 3: token probabilities'\n      - API with logprobs\n      - 0.9\n      - per-item contamination scoring\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power-information frontier plot — x-axis = information access level (ordinal:\n    binary < retest < token probs < logits < weights), y-axis = mean AUROC at 15%\n    contamination. IRT-FIT defines the leftmost (minimal-information) point. Clear\n    monotone increasing trend. Annotated with each method''s applicability scope (number\n    of models testable).'\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves for all three methods on MMLU@15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve\n    clearly below but meaningfully above chance. Gap most visible in the low-FPR region\n    (0-0.1 FPR).'\n  analysis: 'Baseline comparison 确认了 minimal-information 的代价是可量化的 ~13pp AUROC gap\n    vs ConStat。 这是论文的 honest framing 而非 weakness：IRT-FIT 不是要 beat baselines， 而是要定义\n    detection frontier 的 minimal-information 端点，并量化 \"如果你只有 binary responses，你能做到什么\"。\n    Power-information frontier 图将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*，\n    提供模型级整体污染指标。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lzm_formula: lzm = Σ_b w_b × lz*_b / sqrt(Σ_b w_b²) where w_b = 1/SE(lz*_b)\n    lzm_gemini15: 3.82\n    lzm_gpt4o: 2.15\n    lzm_claude35_sonnet: 1.89\n    lzm_qwen25_72b: 1.74\n    lzm_llama31_70b: 1.42\n    lzm_mean: 2.05\n    lzm_sd: 0.78\n    cross_bench_consistency_before_lzm: 0.35\n    cross_bench_consistency_after_lzm: N/A (lzm is a single score)\n    lzm_vs_mean_lz_star_correlation: 0.91\n    lzm_incremental_value_over_mean: moderate — proper variance weighting helps for\n      unequal benchmark sizes\n    lzm_auroc_ctrl_15pct: 0.82\n    lzm_vs_best_single_benchmark_auroc: +0.03 over MMLU alone\n    lzm_flagged_at_alpha005: 4/12 models (Gemini-1.5, GPT-4o, model_X, model_Y)\n  result_rationale: \"Multiscale lzm 通过 inverse-variance weighting 聚合跨 benchmark 的\\\n    \\ lz*， 理论上应该提高检测力（多个弱信号的联合强于任何单一信号）。\\n在 median 档下，改善是\\\"moderate\\\"而非 dramatic：\\\n    \\ - lzm AUROC 0.82 仅比最佳单 benchmark (MMLU, 0.79) 高 3pp，\\n  因为 MMLU 的 weight 最大（n=14K,\\\n    \\ SE 最小），其他 benchmark 贡献有限。\\n- 小 benchmark (ARC-C, HumanEval) 因 SE 大，在 lzm 中几乎被\\\n    \\ downweight 到 negligible。\\nlzm 与简单 mean(lz*) 的相关性 0.91，表明 variance weighting\\\n    \\ 的增量价值有限 但在 benchmark 大小差异极端时（14K vs 164 items）理论上更 principled。\\n实际价值更多是方法论的完整性——展示\\\n    \\ IRT person-fit 框架可以 naturally  扩展到 multi-test setting，而非提供显著的 practical improvement。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: lzm Scores for Phase B Models (Top 6)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - lzm\n    - rank\n    - mmlu_lz_star\n    - hellaswag_lz_star\n    - gsm8k_lz_star\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n      - 3.82\n      - 1\n      - 31.8\n      - 28.4\n      - 15.2\n      - strongest overall aberrance\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - 2.15\n      - 2\n      - 22.5\n      - 18.9\n      - 9.8\n      - moderate aberrance\n    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n      - 1.89\n      - 3\n      - 20.1\n      - 17.2\n      - 8.5\n      - moderate\n    - - Qwen2.5-72B\n      - 1.74\n      - 4\n      - 19.8\n      - 15.1\n      - 7.2\n      - moderate\n    - - LLaMA-3.1-70B\n      - 1.42\n      - 5\n      - 16.2\n      - 14.8\n      - 6.1\n      - low-moderate\n    - - '[smallest model]'\n      - 0.45\n      - 12\n      - 5.2\n      - 3.8\n      - 2.1\n      - low\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: lzm distribution across 12 Phase B models — histogram with Gemini-1.5 as\n    clear outlier. Dashed line at lzm=1.96 (theoretical threshold). Most models above\n    threshold due to universal misfit, but Gemini-1.5 far above the rest.'\n  analysis: 'lzm 提供了一个 principled single-number 污染指标，但在 median 档下 增量检测力有限（+3pp AUROC）。其价值更多是概念性的——完成了从\n    single-benchmark lz* 到 model-level assessment 的理论扩展。 适合放在论文中作为 methodology contribution，但不应作为主要\n    selling point。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 信号在 RL 后是否保留。 回应 Wang\n    et al. (2025)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pre_rl_lz_star: 23.8\n    pre_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.78\n    pre_rl_delta_lz_star: 5.3\n    post_rl_lz_star: 21.1\n    post_rl_accuracy_mmlu: 0.8\n    post_rl_delta_lz_star: 2.6\n    post_rl_signal_retention: 0.49\n    post_rl_still_detectable: marginal (p=0.08)\n    clean_post_rl_lz_star: 19.2\n    clean_post_rl_accuracy: 0.74\n    clean_post_rl_delta_from_clean_pre_rl: 0.7\n    signal_attenuation_pct: 51\n    rl_smoothing_effect: GRPO redistributes probability mass, partially smoothing\n      aberrant item-level patterns\n    detection_auroc_post_rl_15pct: 0.65\n    detection_auroc_pre_rl_15pct: 0.79\n  result_rationale: 'Wang et al. (2025) 证明 RL (PPO/DPO) 后 MIA-based 方法（Min-K%++ 等）检测力\n    大幅下降——因为 RL 重新分配了 token-level 概率分布，抹去了 memorization 的  token-level 签名。\n\n    IRT-FIT 操作在 binary response level，理论上对 token-level 变化更 robust—— 只要模型仍然在不该答对的题目上答对，lz*\n    就会偏离。但 GRPO 也会部分 平滑 item-level patterns：(1) RL reward 通常基于 overall task performance  而非单\n    item accuracy，鼓励模型\"均匀化\"知识分布；(2) policy gradient 更新 可能让模型遗忘一些 SFT 过拟合的特定 items。\n\n    Median 档预测：信号衰减约 50%（5.3 → 2.6 Δlz*），marginal detection (p=0.08)。 不像 MIA 方法完全失败，但也不能声称\"robust\n    to RL\"。 这符合\"medium effect, conditional detection\"的整体 narrative。 AUROC 从 0.79 降到\n    0.65——仍然 above chance 但不再 reliable。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - accuracy\n    - lz_star\n    - delta_lz_star_from_clean\n    - detection_p\n    - auroc\n    rows:\n    - - Clean (pre-RL)\n      - 0.71\n      - 18.5\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Clean (post-RL)\n      - 0.74\n      - 19.2\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.53\n    - - Contaminated 15% (pre-RL)\n      - 0.78\n      - 23.8\n      - 5.3\n      - 0.028\n      - 0.79\n    - - Contaminated 15% (post-RL)\n      - 0.8\n      - 21.1\n      - 2.6\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.65\n    note: 'GRPO training: 3 epochs, reward = accuracy on held-out reasoning tasks.\n      Signal retention = post-RL delta / pre-RL delta = 49%.'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Signal attenuation trajectory — lz* over RL training steps (0, 500, 1000,\n    2000, 5000 steps) for contaminated (red) and clean (blue) models. Gap narrows\n    progressively. Annotated with AUROC at each checkpoint.'\n  analysis: 'Post-RL 信号衰减 ~50% 是一个 nuanced result：优于 MIA 方法的\"完全失败\" 但不能声称 robust。论文应这样\n    frame：\"IRT-FIT 的 binary-level 操作比 token-level  方法更 resilient to RL smoothing，但\n    post-RL detection 仍然是一个 open challenge。\" Priority P2 合理——这是一个重要的 discussion point\n    但不是核心贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Benchmarks — BBH and MATH\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: '添加 BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_4pl_params_available: partial — PSN-IRT may have BBH but needs verification\n    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n    bbh_sim_power_5pct: 0.18\n    bbh_inverted_u_r2: 0.82\n    bbh_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.71\n    math_4pl_params_available: likely not in PSN-IRT; may need calibration\n    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.65\n    math_sim_power_5pct: 0.14\n    math_inverted_u_r2: 0.79\n    math_ctrl_contam_auroc_15pct: 0.67\n    power_curve_r2_with_bbh_math: 0.93\n    power_curve_r2_without: 0.88\n    n_items_threshold_confirmation: ≥5K items needed for AUROC>0.65 at 15%\n  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 恰好落在 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag\n    (10042)  之间，填补了 power curve 中 1K-10K 区间的数据空白。\n\n    BBH 预期 power 0.72——接近 HellaSwag (0.733) 因为 item 数接近， 但 BBH 的 item 结构不同（多步推理题），可能导致\n    4PL 拟合更差。 MATH 预期 power 0.65——处于 GSM8K 和 BBH 之间。\n\n    这两个 benchmark 的加入主要价值是让 power vs n_items 曲线拟合更精确 （R² 从 0.88 提升到 0.93），加强了 \"n_items\n    threshold\" 的理论论证。 但 4PL 参数可用性是风险点——如果 PSN-IRT 没有这些 benchmark 的参数， 需要自己校准，GPU 预算可能显著增加。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Power Curve Data Points (Complete)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - sim_power@15%\n    - ctrl_auroc@15%\n    - source\n    rows:\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.54\n      - existing\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 1172\n      - 0.129\n      - 0.58\n      - existing\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.63\n      - existing\n    - - MATH\n      - 5000\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.67\n      - new\n    - - BBH\n      - 6511\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.71\n      - new\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.74\n      - existing\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.79\n      - existing\n    note: ARC-C power anomalously low for its n_items — item parameter distribution\n      (narrow difficulty range) reduces effective information.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items curve with all 7 benchmarks. Log-x scale. Fitted theoretical\n    curve (from exp-power-theory) with confidence band. BBH and MATH points fall within\n    prediction interval, confirming the theoretical relationship.'\n  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 加强了 power-n_items 关系的实证支撑，使\"≥5K items for reliable detection\"\n    的 claim 更可信。但如果 4PL 参数需要自行校准，优先级应保持 P2—— 这是 nice-to-have 而非 essential。\n\n    '\n- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面性还是集中性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_mmlu_subjects: 57\n    n_subjects_with_sufficient_items: 42\n    min_items_per_subject_threshold: 100\n    gemini15_n_subjects_flagged: 38\n    gemini15_flagged_rate: 0.9\n    gemini15_domain_lz_star_mean: 5.2\n    gemini15_domain_lz_star_sd: 2.8\n    gemini15_top_aberrant_domains:\n    - abstract_algebra (lz*=9.1)\n    - college_mathematics (lz*=8.7)\n    - formal_logic (lz*=8.3)\n    gemini15_least_aberrant_domains:\n    - high_school_us_history (lz*=1.2)\n    - world_religions (lz*=1.5)\n    gemini15_stem_vs_humanities_lz_star_diff: 2.1\n    gemini15_contamination_pattern: broad but STEM-concentrated\n    other_models_domain_concentration_gini: 0.45\n    domain_specificity_varies_by_model: true\n  result_rationale: 'Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 100% accuracy + lz*=34.75 + θ=0.78 表明大规模污染。\n    Domain-level 分析可以区分：(1) 均匀污染（所有 subject 同样 aberrant）vs  (2) 集中污染（某些 domain 远比其他更\n    aberrant）。\n\n    预测 Gemini-1.5 是\"broad but STEM-concentrated\"——90% 的 subjects 被标记 表明污染覆盖面广，但 STEM\n    domains（数学、逻辑）的 lz* 更高， 可能因为这些 domain 的 item difficulty 分布更极端（有更多真正 hard items），\n    污染导致的 aberrance 更显著。文科 domain 的 items 整体较易， 即使没有污染高能力模型也能做对大多数，aberrance 信号更弱。\n\n    Gini 系数 0.45 表明中等集中度——不完全均匀但也非极端集中。 这与\"SFT 在完整 MMLU 上训练\"的假说一致——训练覆盖所有 subject，\n    但不同 subject 的检测灵敏度取决于 item difficulty 分布。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain Analysis (Top/Bottom 5)'\n    columns:\n    - domain\n    - n_items\n    - accuracy\n    - lz_star\n    - flagged\n    rows:\n    - - abstract_algebra\n      - 100\n      - 1.0\n      - 9.1\n      - 'yes'\n    - - college_mathematics\n      - 100\n      - 1.0\n      - 8.7\n      - 'yes'\n    - - formal_logic\n      - 126\n      - 1.0\n      - 8.3\n      - 'yes'\n    - - college_physics\n      - 102\n      - 1.0\n      - 7.9\n      - 'yes'\n    - - electrical_engineering\n      - 145\n      - 1.0\n      - 7.5\n      - 'yes'\n    - - '...'\n      - '...'\n      - '...'\n      - '...'\n      - '...'\n    - - world_religions\n      - 171\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.5\n      - 'no'\n    - - high_school_us_history\n      - 204\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.2\n      - 'no'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: MMLU domain-level lz* heatmap for Gemini-1.5 — 57 subjects sorted by lz*.\n    Color gradient from white (low aberrance) to dark red (high aberrance). STEM cluster\n    visually prominent. Superimposed: mean item difficulty per subject (blue line)\n    showing correlation with lz*.'\n  - 'Fig: STEM vs Humanities lz* boxplots for Gemini-1.5, showing significant difference\n    (p<0.01). Other models shown as gray background for comparison — most show no\n    STEM/Humanities lz* difference.'\n  analysis: Domain analysis 为 Gemini-1.5 case study 增加了 granularity——不仅是\"flagged\"，\n    而是\"STEM-concentrated broad contamination\"。这在论文中可以用 1-2 段讨论， 展示 IRT-FIT 的 diagnostic\n    能力不仅限于 binary flagging。 但因为只有 Gemini-1.5 有 100% accuracy（其他模型无此极端 pattern）， 这个分析的\n    generalizability 有限。\n","numLines":1390,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1390}}}
